<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">1 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Sa</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 Samuel</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Samuel Uk Kheitnaw</char> kyahin Israel minphuin kya byapiatu hae she kyate siapharan she kalan a paleihkunaw kong a um. Tuhcite a paleihkunaw kyaze abyapi huaccepaw ccungccaw lu thum um hae zah, tuh-e hae tuh: Alesaepaw byapiatu hae kyaze nyathyakou byapiatu athuapaw Samuel, Israel hae kyaze masaty siapharan athuapaw Saul te David nynh athua hae; David nynh kawhoitu lang a la tang mawze rawthungte a la cyipaw kha Samuel te Saul kong ryte a tualeihkuh.</para>
  <para style="ip">E ccauh nynh abyapi lan a langsahkupaw tuh, Pachia tungvaw lungzinaw nynh laansui-uanaw thuakhae zah, kawngae leinaw nynh ronaw a thuakhae, cipaw nynh thua. E bya hynh Pachia nynh ranpibawi Eli a hopyapaw kya ccaerarih lan ah muih oh: “Saw yn tua hae paw tuh saw ka tua cih hae zah, yn theihrya hae paw tuh theihryanaw a ccou cih hae,” cite 2.30 kya a um.</para>
  <para style="ip">E ccauh kyahin siapharan uknaw raenaw kong kya thinlung aloku leinaw kha a zei hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> amaw ccaccei hynh Israel siapharan ccaccing cite a tua hae, thuasalama ccungccaw hae nynh a ngia hae keiccuze siapharan kha a popya hae. Abyapipaw ccangkheit tuh siapharan te Israel hae nynh Pachia uknaw te byapianaw zakaw khe hoyte a um hae (2.7-10). Pachia kawbya zakaw khe a hoirumpaw te a ryachipaw, ccungccaw balyn tuh phe lokuh hae.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel uktu Samuel (1.1—7.17)</para>
  <para style="io1">Saul tuh siapharan lang a tang (8.1—10.27)</para>
  <para style="io1">Saul uknaw kya masaty kum hae (11.1—15.35)</para>
  <para style="io1">David te Saul (16.1—30.31)</para>
  <para style="io1">Saul te a ccapaw hae chinaw (31.1-13)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Samuel Puinaw te Thyaasahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Efraim muaram kya Ramathaim-zofim khua khe ccungccapaw lu kheit um zah a min tuh Elkanah acikuh; aning tuh Jeroham ccapaw, Jeroham tuh Elihu ccapaw, Elihu tuh Tohu ccapaw, Tohu tuh Efraim phinpaw Zuf ccapaw nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Elkanah tuh zu zuning a hoi; lu kheit min tuh Hannah cikuh zah, ccangpaw lu kheit min tuh Peninnah acikuh. Peninnah tuh ccaaw a hoi, thuasalama Hannah tuh ccaaw hoi khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Elkanah tuh vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha beik khylan te silaw khylan a umnaw khua kyate Shiloh khua lang kum takyh a cceih. Eli ccapaw hae lu ning Hofni te Finehas tuh Shiloh khua kyaze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ranpibawi hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Elkanah nynh si a law nin khe, a zu Peninnah te a ccapaw hae te a ccanung hae balyn kha mih hanpaw raveih kha a pya hae; <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Hannah kha ccaawsaahnaw kaw a pya khyh zemah, Elkanah nynh a sungsah keiccuze ccoupaw leit ning kha a pya. <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ccaawsaahnaw kaw a pya khyh keiccuze a rhawnung nynh amaw kha a thinriasah khylan palei a ccyaku. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhcite kum kheit koute kum kheit palei acyihkuh; Hannah nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lang a ccia takyhte, Peninnah nynh leih a ccyaku. Tukeiccuze Hannah tuh rah zah looh mah leih ae khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />A vawpaw Elkanah nynh, “Hannah, pawccemou na raw? Pawccemou na ae khyh? Pawccemou na ngaethya? Kae tuh nang na hanlan ccapaw lu haw laeze ka hoyhua khaw?” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Shiloh khua kya a ae a neih kou hae te, Hannah tuh thokuh zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe saw a sang. Ranpibawi Eli tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn thuakawtung pe umpaw haungnaw kyakhe a haung. <verse number="10" style="v" />Hannah tuh a lungria myarya thae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sawsang zah thawte a rah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Hannah nynh hynh-e byakinkunaw hynh a rae: “Pou vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na seenung ka riathaenaw hynh muihpyate nae liathui zah, na seenung hynh ning leite, ccapise nae pya zetuh, a hiin lungkhu balyn amaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan ka pya cih. Misutui te ruithyapaw atui kha neih lan khyh zah, a sang kha ngo thua lan khyh,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:5">Nam 6.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang saw a sang cciamang lyakhe, Eli nynh a mung kha phang a do. <verse number="13" style="v" />Hannah nynh roi accae lei lante saw a sang; a mung kyalya kha piasah zah, a roi tuh thae lan a um khyh keiccuze aruipaw nynh thua cite Eli nynh a tua. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Eli nynh amaw kha, “Hohseciamou na rui ung cih? Na misutui kha ccaring nung ccavae,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama Hannah nynh, “Thua khyh, ka bawipaw, kae tuh myarya a lungriathaepaw nopinung nynh ka thua; misutui thuasah, ruithyapaw atui thuasah ka neih khyh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe ka thinlung kha nynh ka laee. <verse number="16" style="v" />Na seenung hynh nopi hoyleipaw lang yn ria nan, pawccecize myarya lepaw ka lungriathaenaw te ka ngaethyanaw kha nynh ka ho cciamang,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tetuh Eli nynh, “Ngaengante la cceih ccavae; Israel Pachia nynh na ngiakupaw kha ae pya vae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Hannah nynh, “Na seenung kae tuh na malang maehoynaw ka mue vae sah,” a cipya. Te nopinung tuh a umnaw lang cceih zah a vawpaw ryte ae hae neih hae zah, ngaethyanaw maesue hoi vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin tuh awkhua takaw te tho hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik hae; te Ramah khua umpaw mih inn langkhe a ki hae. Elkanah nynh Hannah kha ikhae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Hannah kha a liathui. <verse number="20" style="v" />Accyh yn zaw te, Hannah tuh ccaawpoi zah ccapaw kha a saah, tuh-e ccapaw tuh Samuel cite min a phu, pawccecize aning nynh, “Amaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan ka ngiakupaw nynh thua,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Elkanah te a innbyn hae balyn tuh kum takyh raepaw silawnaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan rae khylan te bya a kinkupaw kha pya khylan a cceih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama Hannah tuh cceih khyh, pawccecize aning nynh a vawpaw kha, “Imua tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang thuakhaete, tuin kya zungzae a um nawlan, mateitui phia athua koute palou ka cciakhae cih; aning tuh thyaasahpaw ccungccaw lang zungzae hanlan ka pya cih,” a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />A vawpaw Elkanah nynh, “Ahoyhua na ci hawte cyih, mateitui na phia mawlaezung ngaw hing; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a bya palia kha tynsah vae sah,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze nopinung nynh mateitui a phia mawlaezung um zah imua kha matei a zusah. <verse number="24" style="v" />Imua kha mateitui he a phia te, kum thum acihpaw tangnuapaw sa kheit, chanvuih ephah ccangkheit te misutui ling kheit ryte imua kha cciakhae zah, Shiloh khua umpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya a thuakhae; imua tuh a no ung. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tangnuapaw kha theih hae zah, imua kha Eli kalan a cciakhae hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te Hannah nynh, “Pou ka bawipaw! Na hiin thyhte, ka bawipaw, kae tuh hynh-e kya namaw malang thadynte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan saw a sangpaw nopinung kha nynh ka thua. <verse number="27" style="v" />E imua hanlan saw ka sang zah ka ngiakupaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn pya vae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze amaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan ka hohsaku vae; a hiin lungkhu balyn, aning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan pya athua vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">Te nopinung nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan tuin kyakhe a cciataw vae.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Hannah Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hannah nynh sawsang zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.1-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:46-55">Luk 1.46-55</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">“Ka thinlung tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungtua;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka thawzung tuh ka Pachia kya</para>
  <para style="q2">hangthung athua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ka taenaw kyakhe ka lungtua keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">ka khalang nynh ka rhaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a sarya hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hawte Athyaapaw</para>
  <para style="q2">humhung mah um khyh,</para>
  <para style="q1">namaw laelan humhung mah</para>
  <para style="q2">um khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ah Pachia alopaw Lungpi um khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lysakute byaho nan vae oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">nae mung kyate tansakunaw bya</para>
  <para style="q2">pousah nan oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tynre nyhpaw Pachia thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">cyipaw miakaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">akhin a saetu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thawsae hae paw li tuh akhya,</para>
  <para style="q2">thuasalama a nyaa hae paw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">thawzung a hoi hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mih vueso hae paw tuh looh mueku</para>
  <para style="q2">khylan vaeluakuh hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama mih vuelaw hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih vuelaw vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">A tin hae paw tuh ccaaw lu sari</para>
  <para style="q2">a saah vae hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama ccaaw patae</para>
  <para style="q2">a hoipaw tuh a lanme vae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh theih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a hiinsah hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Michi khua lang sahbung hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a thosah thui hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ryachisah hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">a hoirumsah hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">zakawsangsah hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">hang mah a hangthung hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bawi hae ryte haungsah kheih lan te</para>
  <para style="q2">sawtuanaw tungkhung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccou khylan,</para>
  <para style="q1">a ryachipaw kha laenoi kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">hangthung zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a nyaapaw kha buhhaw apumkuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">kyate a hangthung.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize laephi tung hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e tung hae vawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">laephipi kha a nung.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Alungzipaw a ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">ccu kha a thungkhaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama ccungccaw hoylei hae paw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mohnaw kya vua athua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize ccungccaw nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a thawsaenaw liate tae khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rhaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zoihtatyh lan khya athua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">Ahang Huaccepaw nynh vaawlui khe</para>
  <para style="q2">kholung a thyhsah cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh laephi adianaw cia</para>
  <para style="q2">bya a pia cih;</para>
  <para style="q1">a siapharan kha thawzung a pya cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw nynh chitui thuhpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">a ccungccaw huhan kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a hangthung cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Eli Ccapaw hae Hoyleinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Elkanah tuh Ramah khua e a inn langkhe ki zah, imuapaw tuh ranpibawi Eli malang khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rya kha a lah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eli ccapaw hae tuh a ccouseikuh hae; minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha thuasah, <verse number="13" style="v" />ccungccaw hae hanlan ranpibawi hae ryalaw kha thuasah pawlangria khyh hae. Lukhakheit nynh silawnaw a rae vae ze, ranpibawi a ryalahtupaw nynh yn cceih cih zah, saw tuh accoh cciamang lyakhe a kuih te yn ccyngpaw ccangthum lang apheipaw phedung khate <verse number="14" style="v" />talyng-ang khyhze tuiso-ang khyhze talyng-ang khupaw khyhze ang lungkhu langkhe a sua cih; tuh-e apheipaw phedung nynh a sua khopaw balyn tuh ranpibawi nynh a lawkuh cih. Shiloh khua a thua hae paw Israel hae balyn kha tuhcite leih a cyipya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhpiaze, atho kha maee te u athua mawkhe, ranpibawi a ryalahtupaw nynh yn cceih cih zah silawnaw a raetupaw kha, “Ranpibawi hanlan epya lan saw kha yn pya; pawccecize athungkuhpaw na saw kha tuh lawkuh lan khyh, ahepaw saw kha nynh a lawkuh cih,” cite leih a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e paw nynh amaw kha, “Atho hynh maee te kae u ty hin sah, tukoute na ry zeihte na lawkuh cih,” cite a hopya ze, aning nynh, “Thua khyh, atu ccaccei maw nae pya cih; tuhkhyhze tuh ka lawkude vae cih,” cite leih a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuhcite ccangvae hae seinaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya myaryamaw ale; pawccecize minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan pyapaw uccaw hae kha a theihrya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Shiloh Khua e Imuapaw Samuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Imuapaw Samuel tuh laaw te kuakuhpaw ranpibawi angki kha kikute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang rya a lah. <verse number="19" style="v" />A nung nynh angkiccua adihpaw kha leih huipah zah, kum takyhte raepaw silawnaw kha rae khylan a vawpaw ryte a ccia vae hae ze, tuh-e tuh kum takyhte leih a ccyngpya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Eli nynh Elkanah te a zu kha hythua leih pya hae zah, “E nopinung nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a pyapaw lasung hanpaw hynh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh e nopinung kyahin ccaaw ae pyaru vae sah,” a cipya; tukoute mih inn lang leih a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Hannah kha hythua a pya, aning nynh ccaawpoi zah ccapaw lu thum te ccanung lu ning a saah. Imuapaw Samuel tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe a lethung.</para>
  <para style="s1">Eli Innbyn kha Profehbya Honuanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eli tuh myarya taw vae. A ccapaw hae nynh Israel hae balyn kya a cyisahnaw hae te tungkunaw bu thuakaw kya ryalah hae paw nopi hae ryte a ikheih hae paw kha a paaw nynh marya a thae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha, “Hynhcihawpaw uccaw hae hynh pawccemou na cyi oh? Ahoy leipaw na cyi oh paw kha ccungccaw balyn kyate phe ka thae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka ccapaw hae, hynhte cyih nan oh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw hae nynh pong zeihsakuh hae zah ka thaepaw bya tuh bya hoypaw thua khyh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Lu kheit nynh ccangpaw lu kheit tungvaw a sei lanze, lukhakheit nynh Pachia kalan miseipaw hanlan ccawkunaw a raepah kho; thuasalama lukhakheit nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw a sei lanze, hum nynh mou ccawkunaw a raepah vae cih?” a ci. Thuasalama mih paaw bya kha ngae khyh hae; pawccecize minmin chia lanpaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rynaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Imuapaw Samuel tuh a pynrua lethung zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang te ccungccaw malang maehoynaw houhouh a mue.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:52">Luk 2.52</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pachia ccungccapaw nynh Eli kalan yn thua zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, ‘Izip ram, Faro kuihkaw see lang a tang lya hae ze, na minpaaw a innbyn hae kya ka langpyaku hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Aning kha ka ranpibawi lang tang lan, ka silawhang kalan kae lan, mynkhuhpaw u lan te ka malang khe ranpibawi angki kiku lan Israel phin hae balyn kyate ka po; te Israel ccungccaw hae nynh maee te u hae paw ka kya-e pyapaw uccaw hae balyn kha na minpaaw a innbyn hae kalan ka pya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1-4">Exo 28.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:35-36">Lev 7.35-36</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuhte mang athua pite, pawccemou kaw ka pya hae thyhte yn pya hae paw ka kya-e silawnawpaw hae te pyapaw uccaw hae kha karankunaw mit te dote, ka ccungccaw Israel hae nynh yn pya hae paw miakaw kya-e ahoy huaccepaw khate na thosah hae zah, kae laeze na ccapaw hae kha saw na tuahua hae?’ a ci. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh a hopaw tuh: ‘Na innbyn hae te na minpaaw innbyn hae nynh ka malang khe zungzaete a tee a pou cih hae,’ a ci; thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh atu a hopaw tuh: ‘Tuh-e bya tuh kae te sawkuh ccavae sah; pawccecize saw yn tua hae paw tuh saw ka tua cih hae zah, yn theihrya hae paw tuh theihryanaw a ccou cih hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Dotua, na innbyn kya phe taw lan a hiinpaw lu kheit san a um khyh nawlan, na thawzung te na minpaaw innbyn thawzung kha ka vua ccyh tuh yn thua cih. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tetuh Israel hae tungvaw pya athua cih paw hoirumnaw balyn kha lungriathaete karankunaw mit te na do cih; na innbyn kyaze phe taw lan a hiinpaw lu kheit san um lan khyh. <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka silawhang kyate ka vua lei lanpaw na innbyn kya-e lu kheit kyalyapaw tuh na mitmohsah khylan te na lungriathaesah khylan haang athua cih; na innbyn hae balyn tuh thaloi te a chih cih hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Na ccapaw hae lu ning Hofni te Finehas tungvaw yn thua cih paw hynh nang na hanlan muihsahnaw athua cih—parouh mawte nin kheit lungkhu a chih cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 4:11">1Sa 4.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka thinlung te ka tuanaw kya a um thyhte a cyih cih paw, alungzipaw ranpibawi lu kheit kha kamaw hanlan ka langsakuh cih; amaw hanlan atynpaw inn kha ka sakpah cih zah, chitui thuh athuapaw ka ccungccaw malang khe aning nynh a tee a pou zungzae cih. <verse number="36" style="v" />Na ciihan kya-e a laehypaw miakaw nynh ngunphua phe kheit thuasah, sanlou phe kheit thuasah ngiaku khylan amaw kalan oun cceih cih hae zah, Sanlou beihtaraw ka aebua ccaw, ranpibawi te asekuhpaw ryalaw hankhakheit kya beih yn nungbua, cite a hopah cih hae,’ a ci,” cite a hopya.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Samuel kha Konaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Imuapaw Samuel tuh Eli kuihkaw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rya kha a lah. Tuh ccyh lya tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh azya; vizin hae mah azya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe a mit thawzya vae zah hoyte ngawmuih kho lei vae paw Eli tuh amaw khaan kya a ih; <verse number="3" style="v" />Pachia maeekhua tuh chih loh khyh, te Samuel tuh Pachia thingkua a umnaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikinn lungkhu khe a ih. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Samuel! Samuel!” cite ko zah aning nynh, “E kya mang ka um!” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Eli kalan ccue zah, “Nae ko zah kae thua vae,” a cipya. Thuasalama Eli nynh, “Kae ko khyh; bua la ih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze ki zah a ih. <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Samuel!” cite bua a ko. Samuel nynh thokute Eli kalan cceih zah, “Nae ko zah kae thua vae,” a cipya. Thuasalama Eli nynh, “Ka ccapaw, kae ko khyh; bua la ih,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Samuel nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha nyh loh khyh zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh a kalan phypya thua loh khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Samuel kha vae thumnaw a ko. Aning nynh thokute Eli kalan cceih zah, “Nae ko zah kae thua vae,” a cipya. Tetuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh imuapaw kha a ko cipaw Eli nynh a ny. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Eli nynh Samuel kha, “La cceih lah, la ih; aning nynh he ae ko ze, nang nynh, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, yn hopah, na ryalahtupaw nynh phang ka ngae,’ na cipah cih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Samuel tuh cceih zah a umnaw kya a ih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh yn cceih zah tuin kya yn thadyn zah, “Samuel! Samuel!” cite langmaw a komae hawte bua a ko. Te Samuel nynh, “Hotua ccaleih, na ryalahtupaw nynh phang ka ngae,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Samuel kha, “Dotua, a thaepaw miakaw a nakaring voi ning mawte ringtering lan accae cih paw ccangkhakheit kha Israel hae tungvaw kya vyavya ka rae vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin nin vae tuh Eli innbyn te asekuh lante ka honua vae paw balyn kha athonaw te athangnaw cia ka ccingsah cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />A ccapaw hae nynh Pachia the a thyasahnaw hae paw hoyleinaw kha mang a nyh pite, minmin kha a khee khyh hae keiccuze, a innbyn kha zungzae hanlan vyavya de ka tah vae, cite ka hopya vae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Eli innbyn kya-e hoyleinaw tuh silawnaw te thuasah, pyapaw uccaw te thuasah seishawnaw raepya kho papin thua vae lan khyh, cite Eli innbyn tungvaw kya bya ka kinku vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel tuh tuin kya khuadae cia a ih; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn e thuakaw hae kha a hung. Samuel nynh tuh-e vizin tuh Eli kya hopya lan a rih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Eli nynh Samuel kha, “Ka ccapaw, Samuel,” cite ko zah, Samuel nynh, “E kya mang ka um,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eli nynh, “Pawmou ae hopya? Kae hynh yn phei nan. Ae hopyapaw balyn kha ccangkhakheit nae phei zetuh, Pachia nynh na tungvaw kya tuhlae accih lante cyih vae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Samuel nynh pawpaw mah phei leite marya a hopya. Tetuh Eli nynh, “Amaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thua; ahoy a cipaw kha cyih vae sah,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuel tuh yn lethung, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a kya um zah, a bya kha kaw kheit sanmah laekhu lang ccawsahpah khyh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Israel hae balyn nynh, Dan khua kyate Beersheba khua kyacia, Samuel tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> profeh doliaku lan umpaw nynh thua cipaw a ny hae. <verse number="21" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh Shiloh khua kya palei a langkuh, Shiloh khua kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> amaw ccaccei nynh Samuel kalan khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya lante a phyku.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Samuel bya tuh Israel hae balyn kalan a thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Thingkua A Law hae</para>
  <para style="p">Tuin ccyh lyakhe Filistin hae tuh Israel hae kha dou khylan a sueluakuh hae, te Israel hae tuh minmin dou khylan Ebenezer khua kya rya hae zah, Filistin hae tuh Afek kya a rya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Filistin hae tuh Israel hae kha dou khylan atantante um hae zah, rhaw he a tuk hae tuh Filistin hae nynh Israel hae kha tae hae zah, rhawtuknaw hmin kya thong pali loukaw a chih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Rhawkaw hae tuh ryahmin kalan he oun thua hae te, Israel piccan hae nynh, “Pawccemou atunin kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Filistin hae malang khe rhaw oun shungsah? <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh aening kalan yn cceih zah ah rhaw hae thungnaw kyate oun khum nawlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua kha Shiloh khua kyate hynh-e kalan cciakhae oh sih,” a ci hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Shiloh khua langkhe ccungccaw saw hae zah, cherubim laku kya umpaw vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua tuh tuin kyate a cciakhae hae. Eli ccapaw hae lu ning Hofni te Finehas tuh Pachia byakin thingkua ryte a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Exo 25.22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua tuh ryahmin kalan he a thuakhae hae te, Israel hae balyn tuh laephi phe thyh lan thawte a sia hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e a siarua hae paw roi kha Filistin hae nynh he a thae hae tuh, “Hebru hae ryahmin kya tuhcite thawte a siarua hae paw tuh paw suilan mou athua?” a ci hae. Minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua tuh ryahmin kya a thua vae cipaw he a nyh hae te, <verse number="7" style="v" />Filistin hae tuh rih hae zah, “Mih ryahmin kya pachia hae a thua vae hae,” a ci hae. Te minmin nynh, “Aening hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! Pawccecize hynhcihawpaw hynh langmawlya cyihkuh boi khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Aening hanlan ngaethya lan kou um! E athungpaw pachia hae huhan kyate hum nynh mou oun luesah kho cih? E hae tuh ramkaw kya Izip hae kha shethya aphuinphuin te a theih hae paw pachia hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pou Filistin hae, nae rawthung sah lah, pisepuisaku tua oh, Hebru hae tuh nae see lang a la tang hae hawte, minmin see lang na tang khyh nawlan oh, pisepuisakuh oh lah, rhawtuk oh,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Filistin hae nynh a tuk hae; Israel hae tuh shung hae zah mimaw inn raveih lang a ccue hae. Myarya lepaw chiakunaw um zah, Israel ccu rhawkaw thong sung thum a chih hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pachia thingkua kha a lua hae; Eli ccapaw hae lu ning Hofni te Finehas tuh a chih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Eli Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Benjamin phinpaw lu kheit tuh rhawtuknaw kyate ccue zah, tuin nin khe Shiloh khua kya a thua, a boeining kha seii zah a lu vawlan vuiping a phingku. <verse number="13" style="v" />He a thua te, Eli tuh laanpi pe a haungnaw kya haung zah phang a la ngaw, pawccecize Pachia thingkua hanlan a lungriathae. Tuh-e paw tuh khualae lang yn tee zah thongpang he a hopah hae tuh, a khuapi mawte a rah hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />A siarua hae paw roi kha Eli nynh he a thae te, “Tuh-e siaruanaw roi tuh pawmou athua?” a ci. Te tuh-e ccungccapaw tuh palou yn thua zah, Eli kha a hopya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Eli tuh sung takua kum tarya cih vae zah ngawmuih kho lei lan ciate a mitmoh vae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e paw nynh Eli kha, “Kae hynh rhawtuknaw kyate kae thuapaw nynh thua; rhawtuknaw kyate atunin po kae ccue,” a cipya. Eli nynh, “Ka ccapaw, pawtemou athua?” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Te bya yn thuakhaetupaw nynh, “Israel hae tuh Filistin hae malang te a ccue hae, rhawkaw hae kya myarya lenaw chiakunaw a um; na ccapaw hae lu ning Hofni te Finehas mah a chih hae, Pachia thingkua kha phe a law hae,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuh-e paw nynh Pachia thingkua cite he a ho te, Eli tuh koikua pe umpaw a haungnaw kyate nulang a khuliakuh; a nging khya zah a chih, pawccecize aning tuh taw vae zah ari vae. Eli tuh Israel hae kya kum sung pali cia byapiatu nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eli a monung, Finehas zu tuh ccaawpoi zah a ccaaw vyavya pui. Aning nynh Pachia thingkua kong thuasah, a rangpaw te a vawpaw a chi hae paw kong thuasah he a thae tuh, bakhung zah a ccaaw a pui; pawccecize neitangia ccinaw nynh a thuanua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Vyavya a chi dyn khe nopi hae nynh, “Rih nan, ccapise na saahkuh vae,” a cipya hae. Thuasalama aning nynh byakhung vae khyh hae, pawlangria khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Aning nynh Ikhabod cite min a phu, asuilan tuh, “Phu-enaw tuh Israel kyate a nuekuh vae,” cipaw nynh thua, pawccecize Pachia thingkua tuh rhaw hae nynh lah hae zah, a rangpaw te a vawpaw mah a chih vae hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Phu-enaw tuh Israel kyate a nuekuh vae, pawccecize Pachia thingkua tuh rhaw hae nynh a law vae hae,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh Pachia thingkua kha lah hae zah Ebenezer kyate Ashdod khua lang a cciakhae hae; <verse number="2" style="v" />te Filistin hae nynh Pachia thingkua kha lah hae zah Dagon beikinn lungkhu lang teekhae hae zah Dagon pachia pe khe a nung hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ashdod khuaccaaw hae nynh awkhualan awkhua takaw he a tho hae tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua malang laekhu kya a khuliakuhpaw Dagon kha a muih hae. Tukeiccuze Dagon tuh lah hae zah a umnaw khe bua a nung hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh awkhualan awkhua he a tho hae tuh, Dagon tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua malang laekhu kya a la huekuh, a lu te a kuih voi ning tuh pae zah, thuakawccaw vawlan khe a la khang; Dagon pyn kyalya tuh a la um vae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Dagon ranpibawi hae te Dagon inn lungkhu lang a tee hae paw balyn nynh Ashdod khua umpaw Dagon inn thuakaw kha sy leite atunin cia a kawphalyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ashdod khuaccaaw hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih nynh vawsaw a pya hae, Ashdod khua te a pepan um hae paw kha mih thinphangsah hae zah balyh ccinaw te vawsaw a pya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Ashdod khuaccaaw hae nynh uccaw a umtuzia kha he a muih hae tuh, minmin nynh, “Israel Pachia thingkua a thungnaw nynh aening tungvaw te ah pachia Dagon tungvaw kya vawsaw oun pya keiccuze tuh-e thingkua tuh aening kya a um lanpaw thua khyh,” a ci hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw sawte Filistin bawi hae balyn kha pum hae zah, “Israel Pachia thingkua hynh pawtemou ah cyih cih oh?” a ci hae. Gath khuaccaaw hae nynh, “Pachia thingkua tuh kaening kalan nue thua sah,” a ci hae. Tukeiccuze minmin nynh Israel Pachia thingkua kha Gath khua lang a nue hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama Gath khua lang a cciakhae kou hae te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih nynh tuh-e khua tuh rawse zah myarya lepaw siikunaw kha a umsah; khuaccaaw hae adih ale balyn kha detah hae zah balyh te a ccisah hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel Pachia thingkua kha Ekron khua lang a ky hae. Pachia thingkua tuh tuin khua kya he a thua te, Ekron khuaccaaw hae nynh, “Kaening te kae ccungccaw hae hynh chia khylan Israel Pachia thingkua tuh pawccemou kae kalan oun cciakhae hae?” cite a sia hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw sawte Filistin bawi hae balyn kha pum hae zah, “Israel Pachia thingkua hynh ccanglang ky oh, kaening te kae ccungccaw hae hynh oun chia khyh nawlan amaw a umnaw hmin lang kisah oh,” a ci hae. Pawccecize khua pynpi kya chinawpaw siikunaw a um. Pachia kuih nynh tuin kya vawsaw myarya a pya hae; <verse number="12" style="v" />a chih lei hae paw tuh balyh te ccikhaekuh hae zah, khuapi kya-e siaruanaw tuh vaawlui kyacia a kaethung.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel lang Thingkua A Kikhae hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua tuh Filistin ram kya sawpaw sah sari a um. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te Filistin hae nynh ranpibawi hae te apawe hae paw kha ko hae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua hynh pawtemou kae cyih cih? A umnaw langkhe paw uccaw te mou kae kyde cih cipaw oun hopya tua oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Israel Pachia thingkua kha na ky oh ze, amaw makhaete ky nan oh, cyiseinaw silawnaw khate kisah oh. Tetuh nae ngedan cih zah shawkhaw na thua cih oh,” a ci hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te minmin nynh, “Amaw kae pyathui lanpaw cyiseinaw silawnaw tuh pawmou athua?” cite khia hae zah, minmin nynh, “Filistin bawi hae milu thyhte, sui te raepaw balyh azuh ccangpangaw te sui pazu ccangpangaw kha na pya cih oh; pawccecize nae balyn tungvaw te nae bawi hae balyn tungvaw kya a thuapaw shethya tuh alokuh. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ram a rosahpaw nae balyh azuh hae te nae pazu azuh hae kha na rae cih oh zah, Israel Pachia kha phu-enaw na pya cih oh; naemaw te nae pachia hae te nae ram kya vawsawnaw pya leite poh ae um kho oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Izip hae te Faro nynh mih lung a khungsahku hae hawte pawccemou nae lung na khungsakuh bua cih oh? Aning nynh minmin kha phe ccih lan de a tah kou hae te, minmin nynh Israel ccungccaw hae kha cciasah leite umlae khyh hae zah, minmin tuh a pou hae khaw? <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze vaetuale thawpaw te matei zukuhpaw vaetua pinung, taphu khangkuh boi leipaw sa ning kha vaetuale taphu khang oh, mih taw hae kha tuh a pi te asawkunaw lang, inn lang cciakhae oh. <verse number="8" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua kha lah oh lah, vaetuale vawlan khang oh, te cyiseinaw silawnaw lante na pyathui oh paw sui te raekuhpaw azuh hae kha tuh-e thingkua pe khe ccangpaw thingkua kyakhe nung oh. Te saw oh lah, cceih hae sah. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te dotua oh; amaw ram lang a cceihpaw laanpi Beth-shemesh khua langkhe a ccia zetuh, aening tungvaw kya hynh-e vawsawnaw lepaw a raetupaw tuh amaw nynh thua; thuasalama tuhte athua khyh zetuh, aening oun tuktupaw tuh aning kuih thua khyh, aening tungvaw acyihkuh seipaw nynh thua cipaw ny lan,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh tuhcite a cyi hae; matei zukuhpaw vaetua pinung sa ning kha vaetuale taphu khang hae zah, mih taw hae kha inn kya a khung hae. <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua ryte sui te raekuhpaw mih balyh azuh hae te sui pazu hae a nungnaw hae paw thingkua kha vaetuale vawlan a khang hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaetua hae tuh Beth-shemesh laanpi langkhe lawbabin lan sia biate a cceih hae; voilang ranglang maekuh khyh hae, Filistin bawi hae nynh Beth-shemesh ramri cia a zui hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Beth-shemesh khuaccaaw hae tuh accya kya mih chanvuih a rue cciamang hae. Ngawdo hae zah thingkua kha he a muih hae tuh, lungpawte a cciadue hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaetuale tuh Beth-shemesh khuapaw Joshua loo lungkhu lang tee zah tuin kya a thadyn. Tuin kya lungtungpi a um; vaetuale thingphe kha koi hae zah vaetua hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan maee-ute silawnaw lang a mang hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Levi phin hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua te a pe umpaw thingkua, sui uccaw hae a umnahpaw kha lah hae zah, lungtungpi vawlan a nung hae. Te Beth-shemesh khuaccaaw hae nynh maee-ute silawnaw kha rae hae zah, tuin nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan silawnaw a rae hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Filistin bawi lu pangaw hae nynh tuh-e tuh he a muih hae te, tuin nin khe Ekron khua lang a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan cyiseinaw silawnaw lang a pyathui hae paw sui balyh azuh hae tuh: Ashdod khua hanlan ccangkheit, Gaza khua hanlan ccangkheit, Ashkelon khua hanlan ccangkheit, Gath khua hanlan ccangkheit, Ekron khua hanlan ccangkheit nynh thua; <verse number="18" style="v" />Filistin bawi hae nynh a uk hae paw khuapi hae balyn kha alung azya thyhte, akoihkuhpaw khuapi hae thuasah, akoihkuh leipaw khuapi hae thuasah sui pazu azuh hae kha a pya hae. A pe kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua a nungnaw hae lungtungpi tuh Beth-shemesh khuapaw Joshua loo kya atunin cia ccaekia lang a um ung.</para>
  <para style="s1">Kiriath-jearim kya Thingkua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Beth-shemesh khuaccaaw hae abang, sung sari kha a chia hae, pawccecize minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua kha a do hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha patae a chia hae keiccuze ccungccaw hae tuh rawkhuite a um hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Beth-shemesh khuaccaaw hae nynh, “E athyaapaw Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang hummou a thadyn kho cih? Aening kya a um khyh nawlan hum kalan mou a cceih cih?” a ci hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh Kiriath-jearim khuaccaaw hae kalan khe locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, “Filistin hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua kha bua oun ky vae hae. Oun cceih oh lah, lawkuh oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te Kiriath-jearim khuaccaaw hae nynh oun cceih hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua kha lah hae zah, mua vaw umpaw Abinadab inn langkhe a cciakhae hae. Minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua a do-oihtu lang Abinadab ccapaw Eleazar kha a thyaasah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:2-4">2Sa 6.2-4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 13:5-7">1Sh 13.5-7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim khua kyakhe tuh-e thingkua a thua nin kyate ccyh hynhsepi cia, kum kuin loukaw a um; te Israel hae balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan bawmnaw mue khylan a sia hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Samuel nynh Byapia hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tetuh Samuel nynh Israel hae balyn kyakhe, “Nae thinlung balyn te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan na ki oh zetuh, ramccang pachia hae te Astartes khozinung hae kha nae kyate vua oh. Nae thinlung kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan hawisah oh lah, amaw kyalya kha beik oh, te Filistin hae kuih kyate ae luesah cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel nynh Baal pachia hae te Astartes khozinung hae kha vua hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyalya kha a beik hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te Samuel nynh, “Israel hae balyn kha Mizpah khua kya pum oh, kae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan saw kae sangpah cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin nynh Mizpah khua kya a sueluakuh hae, te tui kha the hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe a bu hae. Tuin nin kya looh-aesung hae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw kae sei vae,” a ci hae. Te Samuel nynh Israel hae kha Mizpah khua kya bya a pia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel hae tuh Mizpah khua kya a sueluakuh vae hae cipaw kha Filistin hae nynh he a thae hae tuh, Filistin bawi hae nynh Israel hae kha a ccianua hae. Tuh-e konglang tuh Israel ccungccaw hae nynh he a thae hae tuh Filistin hae raw kha a rih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Israel ccungccaw hae nynh Samuel kha, “Filistin hae kuih kyate oun khum nawlan sawsang lah, aening hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia kalan dae leite siatua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Samuel nynh matei zu ungpaw tuutaw kha lah zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a pynpi te maee-ute silawnaw kha a rae; Samuel nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan khe Israel hanlan sawsang zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a leih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Samuel nynh maee-ute silawnaw a rae lyakhe Filistin hae nynh Israel hae kha tuk khylan oun naenuaku hae; thuasalama tuin nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Filistin hae kha roi myarya ccae lante kholungthyhsah nua hae zah, mih lung pong a muasah hae; te minmin tuh Israel hae malang khe a ccue vae hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te Israel ccungccaw hae tuh Mizipah khua kyate pou hae zah Filistin hae kha Beth-kar kyacia deehuite a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh Samuel nynh lung kha lah zah Mizpah te Jeshanah laku kya bing zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaening hynh atu cia oun bawm,” ci zah Ebenezer cite min a phu. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Filistin hae tuh rhaw shung hae zah Israel hae ram lang tee vae khyh hae; Samuel she lya balyn tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih nynh Filistin hae kha a rawse hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh Israel hae kya-e a law hae paw khua hae kha Ekron kyate Gath kyacia Israel hae kalan pyathui athua; Israel hae nynh mih ram kha Filistin hae kuih kyate bua a mue hae. Israel hae te Amor hae laku kya mah daenaw a um.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Samuel tuh a hiin lungkhu balyn Israel hae kya byapiatu lang a tang. <verse number="16" style="v" />Kum takyhte Bethel, Gilgal te Mizpah khua lang po lekuh lan khuaccong zah, tuin khua hae balyn kyakhe Israel hae kha bya a pia hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukoute a inn a umnaw Ramah khua lang a ki; tuin khua khe Israel hae kha byading te a uk hae, te tuin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang silawhang kha a rae.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Siapharan Ngianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel nynh he a taw te, a ccapaw hae kha Israel hae kya byapiatu lang a nung hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />A ccatawccaw min tuh Joel thua zah lu ningnaw a ccapaw min tuh Abijah nynh thua; minmin tuh Beersheba khua kya byapiatu hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuhzemah a ccapaw hae nynh a laanpi kha zui khyh hae, muenaw kalan khe a cceihsei hae; pyaruh kha lawkuh hae zah byading kha a ro hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh Israel piccan hae balyn tuh sueluakuh hae zah Samuel kalan Ramah khua lang cceih hae zah, <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nang tuh na taw vae zah na ccapaw hae nynh na laanpi kha zui khyh hae; tukeiccuze ccangpaw minphuin hae hawte, oun uktu lang siapharan oun khangpah,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:14">Deu 17.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhcite, “Oun uktu lang siapharan oun khangpah,” cite he a ho hae tuh, tuh-e bya nynh Samuel kha a lunghoysah khyh. Samuel nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sawsang zah, <verse number="7" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Samuel kha, “Ccungccaw hae nynh ae hopya hae paw bya balyn kha ngaetua; minmin nynh nang kha ae vua khyh hae, minmin kya siapharan ka thuanaw kha yn vua hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Izip ram kyate ka poukhae nin hae kyate atunin cia kae kha yn vua hae zah ccangpaw pachia hae kha beikte ka tungvaw a cyi hae hawte, nang na tungvaw mah a cyi hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Atu tuh mih bya kha ngaepah hae; thuasalama raeringnaw hoyte na pya cih hae zah, minmin a uk cih hae paw siapharan nynh a ukzia kha muihsah hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Samuel nynh amaw kalan siapharan a ngia hae paw kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya balyn kha a hopya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Nanning ae uk cih oh paw siapharan nynh a ukzia tuh hynhte athua cih: nae ccapaw hae kha a ko cih hae zah a marangle ccikuhtu, a marang ccikuhtu te a marangle hae malang a ccuetu lang a nung cih hae; <verse number="12" style="v" />milu thong kheit uktu, milu sung pangaw uktu, lu haw uktu lang a nung cih hae, abang kha leithuetu te a loohruetu, rhawtuk-zunghe raetu te a marangle uccaw raetu lang a nung cih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Nae ccanung hae kha zimuin raetu, anghyngtu te sanlou thoutu lang a ko cih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nae loo, nae misu khokhu te nae oliv khokhu hae lakuze ahoy huaccepaw kha a lah cih zah a ryalahtu hae kha a pya cih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nae ccathae te nae misu khokhu kya-e pumhaw pumkheit kha a lah cih zah a kuihkaw e bawi hae te a ryalahtu hae kha a pya cih hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Nae ryalahtu hae te nae seenung hae, nae vaetua hae te nae lann hae kyaze ahoy huaccepaw kha a lah cih zah a rya a lawsah cih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Nae tuuphu hae kya-e pumhaw pumkheit kha a lah cih zah, nanning tuh a see hae lang na tang cih oh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te tuin nin vae tuh naemaw nynh na poku oh paw nae siapharan keiccuze na sia na rua cih oh; thuasalama tuin nin vae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae leih vae lan khyh oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungccaw hae nynh Samuel bya kha ngae ry khyh hae; minmin nynh, “Thua khyh! Kaening oun uk lanpaw siapharan kae ry, <verse number="20" style="v" />tuhteze nynh ccangpaw minphuin hae te kae lokuh bua cih, kae siapharan nynh oun uk cih zah kae malang toikute kae rhaw hae kha oun tukpah cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Samuel nynh ccungccaw hae bya balyn kha a thae te, tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nakaring kya a hopya. <verse number="22" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Samuel kyakhe, “Mih bya kha ngaepah hae lah, minmin hanlan siapharan khangpah hae,” a cipya. Te Samuel nynh Israel ccungccaw hae kha, “Nae khua raveih lang la ki oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Siapharan lang Saul Ponaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin phin, a min Kish cikuhpaw mihoipaw lu kheit a um; Kish tuh Abiel ccapaw, Abiel tuh Zeror ccapaw, Zeror tuh Bekorath ccapaw, Bekorath tuh Afiah ccapaw nynh thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Kish nynh a min Saul cikuhpaw ccapaw lu kheit a hoi, aning tuh apuithyapaw ccangvae nynh thua. Israel ccungccaw hae laku kya aning laeze a puithyapaw pise um khyh; aning tuh ming hae laeze a lu te a raw ahanghua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saul a paaw Kish kya-e lann hae tuh a zo hae. Tukeiccuze Kish nynh a ccapaw Saul kha, “Mikung lu kheit hoeikute cceih lah, lann hae kha la ccungtua,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh Efraim muaram te Shalishah ram kya po lekuh lan a ccung hae zemah muih khyh hae. Te Shaalim ram kya po lekuh lan a ccung hae zemah, tuin ram kya mah muih khyh hae. Te Benjamin pee kya po lekuh lan a ccung hae zemah muih khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zuf pee kya he a thua hae tuh, Saul nynh a cceihkheih hae paw a mikungpaw kha, “Ki ccavae sih, tuhkhyhze tuh ka paaw nynh lann hae elang a thinphang leite aening elang a thinphangsei cih,” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama a mikungpaw nynh, “E khua kya Pachia ccungccapaw lu kheit a um, aning tuh sawtuanaw a ccoupaw nynh thua. A hopaw bya miakaw tuh accing. Amaw kalan cciatua sih; ah zui lanpaw laanpi kong kha poh oun hopah kho,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul nynh a mikungpaw kha, “Ah ccia lanze ccungccapaw kha pawmou ah ccyngpah cih? Pawccecize ah zaw lungkhu kya sanlou phe thang vae, Pachia ccungccapaw elang ccyngpya lanpaw lasung um khyh. Pawmou ah hoi?” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Mikungpaw nynh Saul kha, “Dotua, ngun shekel tamae ka hoi; ah laanpi oun hopya nawlan tuh-e tuh Pachia ccungccapaw ka pya cih,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />(Israel ram kya langmawlya tuh Pachia kha byakhia khylan a cceihpaw lukhakheit nynh, “Rang, muihtu kalan cceih sih,” cite leih a la ci; pawccecize atu profeh cikuhpaw hynh langmawlya tuh muihtu a la ci hae.) <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul nynh a mikungpaw kha, “Ahoy; rang, cceih sih,” a cipya. Tetuh Pachia ccungccapaw a umnaw khua lang a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khua kalan ccia lan sangpyng kya a kaethung lya hae khe tui the lan oun cceih hae paw liaccaw hae kha tungkuh hae zah, “E kya muihtu a um tou?” cite a khia hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “A um, nae malang khe mang um. Rangsakuh oh, atunin khuaccaaw hae nynh hminthyaa kya silawnaw rae lan a ci hae keiccuze khua lungkhu lang atasy mawkhe nynh a ccia. <verse number="13" style="v" />Khua lungkhu lang he na tee takaw oh te, hminthyaa kalan ae lan a cciathung mawkhe amaw kha na la muih cih oh. Aning nynh silawnaw kha hythua a pya cih keiccuze aning a thua makhia ccungccaw hae nynh ae lan khyh hae; tukoute kopaw ccungccaw hae nynh a ae cih hae. Atu la cceihthung oh, amaw kha palou na la tungkuh cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze khualae lang a cceihthung hae. Khualae he a tee hae tuh, hminthyaa kalan ccia khylan mih kalan yn cceihpaw Samuel kha a muih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul yn thua maw nin khe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Samuel kya phykuh zah: <verse number="16" style="v" />“Awkhualan atu ccyh kya Benjamin pee kya-e ccungccapaw lu kheit kha na kalan kae saw cih zah, tuh-e paw kha ka ccungccaw Israel hae uktu lang chitui na thuh cih. Aning nynh ka ccungccaw hae kha Filistin hae kuih kyate a khum cih hae; pawccecize mih siaruanaw tuh ka kya yn thua zah ka ccungccaw hae teingnaw kha ka muih vae,” a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuel nynh Saul kha he a muih te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Samuel kha, “Kae hopyapaw ccungccapaw kha khah-e paw nynh thua. Aning nynh ka ccungccaw hae kha a uk cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te Saul nynh Samuel kha koikua kalan khe naenuakuh zah, “Pawkyamou muihtupaw inn a um? Beih yn hopya tua,” a cipya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Samuel nynh Saul kha, “Muihtupaw tuh kamaw nynh ka thua; hminthyaa kalan ka malang khe cceih, pawccecize atunin kae te looh aekheih lan, te awkhualan awkhua nang kha kae cciasah cih zah na thinlung kya umpaw balyn kha kae hopah cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Nin thum azo vae paw na lann hae kha tua nan vae hae, pawccecize phe muih vae hae. Te Israel hae balyn nynh hummou a ry hae? Nang te na minpaaw ccaawno hae kha thua khyh tou?” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul nynh, “Kae tuh Israel phin hae kyaze adih huaccepaw Benjamin phinpaw ka thua khyh tou? Kae innbyn tuh Benjamin phin kya-e innbyn hae balyn kyaze anyaa huaccepaw nynh thua. Pawccemou tuhcite nae hopya?” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tetuh Samuel nynh Saul te a mikungpaw kha cciakhae hae zah innkhaan lungkhu lang a teekhae hae, te a ko hae paw ccungccaw sung thum loukaw kyaze sawtua huanaw hmin kyakhe a haungsah hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Samuel nynh anghyngpaw kha, “Nang kae pyapaw, taekhiate kae nungsahpaw hanpaw kha yn lawtua,” a cipya. <verse number="24" style="v" />Anghyngpaw nynh aphae te akyngkuhpaw kha lah zah Saul malang khe a nung. Samuel nynh, “Dotua, kae ccypyapaw tuh na malang nung athua vae. Aetua; pawccecize kopaw mikhia hae ryte na aekheih ccaw oh cite khah-e kha accyh khyapaw kya na malang nung athua vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">Tuhcite tuin nin khe Saul tuh Samuel ryte a aekheih hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Minmin tuh hminthyaa kyate khua lungkhu lang he a cceih hae tuh, innccuvaw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">innccuvaw: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tuh ccyh lya tuh innccuvaw kha abialae lante rae hae zah, tuin kyakhe ccungccaw hae tuh leih a ih hae.</char></note> khe Saul elang inaw phaepah hae zah a ih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Te khuadaetakaw khe Samuel nynh innccuvaw umpaw Saul kha ko zah, “Tho ccavae, kae saw cih,” a cipya. Saul tuh tho zah, Samuel ryte parouhte laanpi lang a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Samuel nynh Saul Chitui Thuh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khuate lang he a thua hae te, Samuel nynh Saul kha, “Na mikungpaw kha ah malang a la ccia lalo nawlan hopah, aning po a cceih lalo koute, nang tuh hein kya sosoh umhy hin, Pachia bya kha kae nysah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel nynh chitui paling kha lah zah Saul lu kha bu zah a myng koute, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccungccaw Israel hae uktu lang chitui ae thuh vae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw hae kha na uk cih hae zah, mih pepan e rhaw hae kuih kyate na khum cih hae. Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccungccaw hae uktu lang chitui ae thuh vae cinawpaw muihsahnaw tuh hynh-e hynh athua cih: <verse number="2" style="v" />Atunin ka kyate he na pou te, Benjamin pee Zelzah khua e Rachel shawku kyakhe pise lu ning na la tungkuh cih oh; minmin nynh nang kha, ‘Ccung lan na ccianuapaw lann hae kha a muih vae hae, atu tuh na paaw nynh lann hae kong kha a thinphang leite, nang na elang kha a thinphang zah: Ka ccapaw konglang hynh pawtemou ka cyih cih? a ci,’ cite ae la hopah cih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te tuin kyate po na la cceih cih zah Tabor phaesi ku kya na la thua cih; tuin kyakhe Bethel e Pachia kalan a cceih hae paw lu thum nynh nang kha ae la tungkuh cih hae, lu kheit nynh miaa taraw sa thum a ccyng cih, ccangpaw lu kheit nynh sanlou ccangthum kha a ccyng cih zah, ccangpaw lu kheit nynh savingtui-ung te misutui kaw kheit kha a ccyng cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh nang kha bya ae beih cih hae, sanlou ccangning kha ae pya cih hae zah na lawpakuh cih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukoute Filistin rhawkaw hae umnaw Gibeath-elohim kya na la thua cih; tuin kya khualae lang na tee lyakhe phyly, tintang, daw, te tyng a khua hae paw kha mih malang nungte hminthyaa kyate oun cceihbung hae paw profeh hae phu kheit kha na la tungkuh cih oh; minmin tuh synku leite profehbya a ho cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh na tungvaw yn thua cih, nang mah minmin ryte synku leite profehbya na hobua cih zah mingccangpaw lang na tang cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuh-e muihsahnaw hae tuh he na tung hae te, cyi lan accan cite na muih thyhte la cyih, pawccecize Pachia tuh na kya a um. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te kae ka malang khe Gilgal lang na la cceih ty cih; maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha rae khylan na kalan kae cceih cih. Na kya kae thua zah na cyi lanpaw kae muihsah mawlaezung nin sari nae la ngaw cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Samuel kyate ccia lan vae cite Saul nynh a maeleihku lyakhe, Pachia nynh thinlung ccangpaw kha a pya; tuh-e muihsahnaw hae balyn tuh tuin nin khe accing. <verse number="10" style="v" />Minmin tuh tuin kyate Gibeah kya he a thua hae te, profeh phu kheit nynh aning kha a tungku hae; te Pachia muisaw tuh aning kya yn thua zah, tuh-e hae ryte synku leite profehbya a hokheih hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul nynh profeh hae ryte profehbya a hobuapaw kha langmawlya Saul a la nyh hae paw balyn nynh he a muih hae tuh, “Kish ccapaw tungvaw kya pawvema acyihkuh? Saul mah profeh lang a tangbua vae vosi?” cite lu kheit te lu kheit a hoku hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin kya-e lu kheit nynh, “Mih paaw tuh hummou athua?” a ci. Tukeiccuze, “Saul mah profeh lang a tangbua vae vosi?” cipaw bya tuh byaphung lang a tang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 19:23-24">1Sa 19.23-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Saul tuh profehbya a ho koute ahangnaw hmin lang a cceih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saul a pupaw nynh Saul te a mikungpaw kha, “Teilangmou na ccia oh?” cite khia hae zah, Saul nynh, “Lann hae ccung lan nynh kae ccia; muih kho thua lan khyh cipaw kae nyh te, Samuel kalan kae cceih,” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul a pupaw nynh, “Samuel nynh paw bya mou ae hopya oh, yn hopya tua,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Saul nynh a pupaw kha, “Lann hae kha a muih vae hae cite yn hopya,” a cipya. Thuasalama Samuel nynh a hopyapaw siapharan lang tangnaw kong kha ccapyh san hopah khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Siapharan lang Saul Kong Phynaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuel nynh ccungccaw hae kha Mizpah khua kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan ko hae zah, <verse number="18" style="v" />“Israel Pachia, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, ‘Israel kha Izip ram kyate ka cciakhae zah Izip hae kuih kyate thuasah, nanning ae tuaa ae sah oh paw peenaw hae balyn kuih kyate thuasah kae luesah oh,’ a ci. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama vawsawnawpi te riathaenaw na teing oh paw balyn kyate ae khum oh paw nae Pachia kha atunin na vua oh zah, ‘Thua khyh! Kae hanlan siapharan oun khangpah,’ na ci oh. Tukeiccuze atu tuh nae phin raveihte, nae puizia raveihte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang poutua oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Samuel nynh Israel phin hae balyn kha poukhae hae zah, Benjamin phin tuh ccungthydungte po athua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin phin kha mih puizia raveihte Samuel nynh poukhae hae zah, Matri puizia hae tuh ccungthydungte po athua hae. Nyathyakou kya Matri puizia hae kha pise raveihte poukhae hae zah Kish ccapaw Saul tuh ccungthydungte po athua. Thuasalama Saul kha ccung hae zah muih khyh hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha bua khia hae zah, “Ccungccapaw kha hein kya yn thua tou?” a ci hae, te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Dotua, uccaw hae laku kya nynh a reku,” a ci. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tetuh ccue hae zah Saul kha tuin kyate a cciakhae hae. Ccungccaw hae malang he a thadyn tuh, tuh-e hae balyn laeze a lu te a raw tuh a hanghua. <verse number="24" style="v" />Samuel nynh ccungccaw balyn kyakhe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a popaw ccungccapaw hynh na muih oh tou? Ccungccaw hae balyn kyaze aning te a lokuh hae paw lu kheit san um khyh,” a ci. Tetuh ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Siapharan tuh a hiinshe sae vae sah!” cite a sia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Samuel nynh ccungccaw hae kha siapharan kawhoinaw te a ryalaw kha a hopya hae; aning nynh tuh-e hae tuh ccauh kya zei zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang a nung. Te Samuel nynh ccungccaw hae kha mih inn raveih lang a kisah hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Saul mah Gibeah khua e a inn lang cceih zah, Pachia nynh mih thinlung a thosah hae paw, mih rawthung hae paw tuh a cceihbua hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama ccungkia lei hae paw nynh, “E paw nynh pawtemou oun khum kho cih?” a ci hae. Saul kha sarya hae zah lasung kha ccyngpah khyh hae. Thuasalama Saul tuh daebabi lan zya a um.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Saul nynh Ammon hae Taenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sawpaw sah kheit aro koute, Ammon minphuinpaw Nahash nynh cceihthung zah Jabesh-gilead khua kha a koihlu; te Jabesh khuaccaaw hae balyn nynh Nahash kha, “Kaening te nawccawkheihnaw rae lah, na rya kae lawpah cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuasalama Ammon minphuinpaw Nahash nynh minmin kha, “Nae ranglang mit kae khoi oh zah, tuhcite Israel hae balyn tungvaw kya thethyanaw ka rae ze nynh, nanning ryte nawccawkheihnaw ka rae cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jabesh khua e piccan hae nynh Nahash kha, “Kaening nynh Israel ram pynpi kalan locceihtu hae kha kae saw nawlan hae, nin sari cia ccyh oun pya hin. Kaening oun khum lanpaw lu kheit san a um khyh ze, namaw kalan kae apkuh cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Locceihtu hae nynh Saul khua Gibeah kya a thua hae te, tuh-e kong tuh ccungccaw hae kha he a thaesah hae tuh, ccungccaw balyn tuh thawte a rah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul tuh tangnuapaw hae nulang zuikute loo langte yn thua; te Saul nynh, “Ccungccaw hae hynh pawccemou a raw hae?” a ci. Tukeiccuze Jabesh khuaccaaw hae thongpang kha a hopya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e thongpang he a thae te, Pachia muisaw tuh Saul tungvaw kya thungnaw te yn thua zah, myaryamaw a thinria. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tangnua toi kheit kha lah zah zoihtatyh lan pong be zah locceihtu hae kuih khate Israel ram pynpi kalan ky hae zah, “Saul te Samuel nulang zuiku lan a pou ry leipaw miakaw tuh a tangnuapaw hae kha hynhcite cyipya athua cih!” cite a hosah pya hae. Tetuh ccungccaw hae tungvaw kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rawrinaw tuh yn thua zah, minmin tuh lungngingte oun pou hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Saul nynh Bezek khua kya he a pum hae tuh, Israel hae cciing thum, Judah hae thong sung sari acih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Jabesh khua kyate oun thua hae paw locceihtu hae kyakhe, “Jabesh-gilead khuaccaaw hae kha, ‘Awkhualan, khuanin aso lyakhe luenaw na mue cih oh,’ cite la hopah oh,” a cipya hae. Locceihtu hae nynh cceih hae zah Jabesh khuaccaaw hae kha he a hopah hae tuh, mih lungtua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jabesh khuaccaaw hae nynh, “Awkhualan kya nae kalan kaemaw toulou kae apkuh cih zah, ahoy na ci oh hawte kae tungvaw na cyih cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Awkhualan khe Saul nynh ccungccaw hae kha phu thum lang a pum hae. Awkhualan awkhua takaw te ryahmin lungkhu lang tee hae zah khuanin aso lan cia, Ammon hae kha a bae hae; te a hiinhy hae paw kha lu ning te a umkheihthya lei lan hae, a phia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae nynh Samuel kha, “ ‘Saul maesae nynh tou aening hynh oun uk cih?’ cite a hopaw kha hummou athua? Kae chia ccaw hae, kae kalan oun pya,” a cipya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama Saul nynh, “Atunin humhung kha mah chia thua lan khyh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae kya atunin luenaw a thuakhae vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samuel nynh ccungccaw hae kha, “Rang oh, Gilgal khua lang cceih oh sih lah, tuin kyakhe siapharan lang tangnaw kha thawsah thui oh sih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw balyn tuh Gilgal khua lang cceih hae zah, Gilgal khua kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe Saul kha siapharan lang a khang hae. Tuin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan ccawkunaw silawnaw kha rae hae zah, Saul te Israel hae balyn tuh myaryamaw mih lungpaw.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Samuel nynh Bya A Hopya hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel nynh Israel hae balyn kyakhe, “Nae hopya oh paw balyn kha kae ngaepah oh zah siapharan kha kae khangpya vae oh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Dotua oh, atu tuh siapharan nynh ae cciakhae vae cih oh; kae tuh ka taw vae zah ka sang mah apaw vae, ka ccapaw hae tuh nae kya a um hae. Ka di lyate atunin cia kae cciakhae vae oh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Hein kya mang ka umphia hynh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang te chitui thuh athuapaw malang kya ccaekiakhanku tua oh. Ahum tangnuapaw mou ka law boi? Ahum lann mou ka law boi? Hummou ka ling boi? Hummou ka tuaa ka sah boi? Ka mit kha mohsaku khylan hum kuih kya-e mou pyaruh kha ka lawku boi? Ka lawkupaw a la um lanze, kae pyaru cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Kaening hynh nae ling khyh, na tuaasah khyh, humhung kuih kya-e uccaw mah na lah khyh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Samuel nynh minmin kha, “Ka kuih kya pawpaw mah na muih khyh oh paw kong kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh nae malang ccaekia thua zah, chitui thuh athuapaw ccungccaw tuh atunin ccaekia nynh thua,” a cipya hae. Te minmin nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ccaekia nynh thua,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Samuel nynh ccungccaw hae kyakhe, “Moses te Aaron kha ryalaw pya hae zah nae minpaaw hae kha Izip ram kyate a poukhae hae paw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ccaekia nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:26">Exo 6.26</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Nanning te nae minpaaw hae hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh khumnaw rya a lawpaw balyn kha kae hopah cih oh, tukeiccuze atu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang bya kae pia ccaw oh thadyn oh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Jakob nynh Izip ram thua zah Izip hae nynh minmin kha he a tuaa a sah hae tuh, nae minpaaw hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sia hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Moses te Aaron kha a saw hae, minmin nynh nae minpaaw hae kha Izip ram kyate poukhae hae zah, e hmin kya a umsah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:23">Exo 2.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> mih Pachia kha a ning hae; te aning nynh minmin kha Hazor siapharan Jabin a rhawbawipaw Sisera kuih kalan thuasah, Filistin hae kuih kalan thuasah, Moab siapharan kuih kalan thuasah a zua hae; rhaw hae nynh minmin kha a tuk hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:12">Bpt 3.12</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 4:2">4.2</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 13:1">13.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Te minmin nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan sia hae zah, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha kae vua zah Baal pachia hae te Astartes pachia hae kha rya kae lawpya keiccuze kae sei vae; thuasalama atu kae rhaw hae kuih kyate oun luesah lah, nang kha kae beik cih,’ a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 10:10-15">Bpt 10.10-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jerubbaal, Barak, Jefthah te Samuel kha saw hae zah, nae pepan e nae rhaw hae kuih kyate ae luesah oh zah, khyndadyh lan na um oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:20">1Sa 3.20</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:6">Bpt 4.6</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 7:1">7.1</ref>, <ref loc="JDG 11:29">11.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Ammon hae siapharan Nahash nynh nanning rawsete ae ccianua oh paw kha he na nyh oh te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh nae siapharan lang mang a tang pite, kae kha, ‘Thua khyh, siapharan nynh oun uk sah,’ cite nae hopya oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:19">1Sa 8.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Dotua oh, na poku oh paw te na ngia oh paw siapharan tuh hein kya a um vae; dotua oh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae hanlan siapharan ae nungpya vae oh. <verse number="14" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha na rih oh zah amaw rya kha lawpyate, a bya kha mah ngaete, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawbya kha rawse leite, nanning te ae uk oh paw siapharan nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha na zui oh lanze ahoy cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ngae leite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawbya kha na rawse oh ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih nynh nanning te nae siapharan kha ae rawse cih oh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu phang thadyn oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nae muihnaw kya a cyih cih paw hynh-e alesaepaw uccaw hynh dotua oh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Atunin hynh chanvuih rue ccyh thua khyh khaw? Kholungthyhsah zah khuaa a rawsah nawlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ka ko cih; nae hanlan siapharan ngiakute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang na rae oh paw hoyleinaw tuh myarya ale cipaw kha na nyh cih oh zah na muih cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Samuel nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ko zah tuin nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kholungthyhsah zah khuaa a rawsah; te ccungccaw balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> te Samuel kha myarya a rih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ccungccaw balyn nynh Samuel kha, “Na see hae kaening hynh kae chi khyh nawlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kalan saw beih oun sangpah; pawccecize kae seinaw balyn vawlan khe kaemaw elang siapharan ngiakupaw hoyleinaw kha kae biachih vae,” a cipya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Te Samuel nynh ccungccaw hae kha, “Rih nan oh; e hoyleinaw balyn hynh na rae vae oh, tuhzemah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> zuinaw kyate ccanglang maeku leite, nae thinlung balyn te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rya kha lah oh; <verse number="21" style="v" />a thane leipaw te a khum kho leipaw, amia um leipaw uccaw hae nulang zuikuh sei nan oh, pawccecize khah-e hae tuh ccungkia leipaw nynh thua hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Alesaepaw a min keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccungccaw hae kha vua lan khyh hae, pawccecize nanning kha amaw ccungccaw lang raeku lanpaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> lungry nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhpiaze nae hanlan sawsang leite ka uk keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw ka sei lanpaw tuh ka kyate sawkuh sah. Akyhpaw te adingpaw laanpi kha kae ccangpah cih oh. <verse number="24" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha rih oh lah, nae thinlung balyn te lungzite a rya kha lah oh; pawccecize nae hanlan ryalaw lepaw a lawpaw kha tua oh. <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama hoyleinaw kha na rae ung oh zetuh, naemaw te nae siapharan kha parouh mawte ae maemih cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Aphung Thua leipaw Saul Silawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul nynh a uk takaw lya tuh kum … acih vae; aning nynh … kum te kum ning lungkhu Israel kha a uk.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hynh Hebru Baebu kya akum phe ccing lan um khyh.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul nynh Israel hae thong thum kha a po hae; thong ning tuh Saul ryte Mikmash te Bethel muaram kya um hae zah, thong kheit tuh Janathan ryte Benjamin ram, Gibeah khua kya a um hae; tuhlaepaw ccungccaw hae kha mih umnaw mih bu raveih langkhe a kisah hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jonathan nynh Beba khua e Filistin rhawkaw hae kha tae zah, tuh-e tuh Filistin hae nynh a thae hae. Te Saul nynh ram pynpi phe lekuh lan, “Hebru hae nynh thae hae sah!” cite mungkae a tu. <verse number="4" style="v" />Saul nynh Filistin rhawkaw hae a tae hae cipaw te Filistin hae nynh Israel hae kha a hua hae cipaw kha Israel hae balyn nynh he a thae hae tuh, Saul kalan Gigal khua langkhe ccungccaw hae kha a ko hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Filistin hae tuh Israel hae te tukku lan marangle thong sung thum, marang rhawkaw thong taruh te rili kin e laesia zeih acih hae paw rhawkaw hae tuh a sueluakuh hae; te cceihthung hae zah Beth-aven khua nithua lang e Mikmash khua khe a rya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel hae nynh vawsawnaw kya nynh kae um cipaw kha he a nyh hae tuh (pawccecize rhawkaw hae tuh myarya a teing hae), ccungccaw hae tuh lungkarung hae, akhunaw hae, lungpi hae, shawku hae te tuisung hae lungkhu khe a rekuh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Abang Hebru hae tuh Jordan vaw kha zua hae zah Gad ram te Gilead ram lang a cceih hae. Saul tuh Gilgal khua kya um ung zah, ccungccaw hae balyn nynh thyngkute a zui hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Samuel nynh accyh a khyapya thyhte nin sari a ngaw; thuasalama Samuel tuh Gilgal lang yn thua khyh zah ccungccaw hae tuh Saul kyate a ccue vae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:8">1Sa 10.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Saul nynh, “Maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha hynhlang ka kalan oun cciakhae oh,” a cipya hae. Aning nynh maee-ute silawnaw kha a rae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Maee-ute silawnaw kha he a rae kou takaw khe Samuel tuh yn thua; Saul nynh tungku khylan cciadue zah salaam a pya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Samuel nynh, “Pawmou na la cyi?” a cipya. Saul nynh, “Ccungccaw hae nynh ka kyate a ccue hae paw kha thuasah, khyapaw accyh kya nae thua khyhpaw kha thuasah, Filistin hae tuh Mikmash khua kya a sueluaku hae paw kha thuasah he ka nyh te, <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Filistin hae nynh ka umnaw Gilgal khua lang yn ccianua vae cih hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thawccinaw kha ka ngia loh khyh,’ ka ci zah, tukeiccuze kamaw te kamaw nangsekute maee-ute silawnaw kha ka rae,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Samuel nynh Saul kha, “Na cyipaw hynh ngaeenaw ccaccing nynh thua; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia nynh ae pyapaw kawbya kha na zui khyh. Na la zui zetuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na peenaw kha Israel hae kya zungzae a tynsah cih, <verse number="14" style="v" />thuasalama atu tuh na peenaw tyn vae lan khyh; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a rypaw thinlung a ccyngkuhpaw ccungccapaw kha a ccung vae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw ae pyapaw kha na zui khyh keiccuze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aning kha a ccungccaw hae a uktu lang a khang vae,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:22">Loc 13.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Samuel tuh thokuh zah Gilgal khua kyate Benjamin ram, Gibeah khua lang a cceih. Tuhlaepaw ccungccaw hae tuh rhawkaw hae kalan ccia khylan Saul kha a zui hae; minmin tuh Gilgal khua kyate Benjamin ram, Gibeah khua lang a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Rhawtuk lan Paccynkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">Saul nynh a kya umpaw rhawkaw hae kha ria hae zah za taruh loukaw acih. <verse number="16" style="v" />Saul, a ccapaw Jonathan te mih kya umpaw ccungccaw hae tuh Benjamin ram, Geba khua kya a um hae; Filistin hae tuh Mikmash khua kya a rya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Filistin hae ryahmin kyate ccungccaw thiingtu hae tuh phu thum lante a pou hae; phu kheit tuh Shual ram, Ofrah khua lang a cceih hae, <verse number="18" style="v" />ccangpaw phu kheit tuh Beth-horon khua lang cceih hae zah, ccangpaw phu kheit tuh ramkaw lang Zeboim accya lang a hawipaw mua langkhe a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel ram pynpi kya sivawsuhtu lu kheit san um khyh, pawccecize Filistin hae nynh, “Hebru hae nynh thaloi hae, ccoi hae kha raekuh lan khyh hae,” a ci hae; <verse number="20" style="v" />tukeiccuze Israel hae balyn tuh mih tamuin, mih muinzung, hae te rungkou kha phe he lan tawku khylan Filistin hae kalan leih a cceih hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tamuin te muinzung tawnaw mee tuh shekel pum thum pum ning thua zah, hae tawnaw mee te thuingnawpaw ccungngue bingnaw mee tuh shekel pum thum pum kheit nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze rhawtuk nin kya Saul te Jonathan holeite, mih kya umbua hae paw ccungccaw hae tuh lu kheit sanmah thaloi te ccoi hoi khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Filistin rhawkaw hae phu kheit tuh Mikmash laansi langkhe a cceih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nin kheit tuh Saul ccapaw Jonathan nynh a rhawtuk-uccaw a ccyngtu ccangvaepaw kha, “Rang, khuhlang raw e Filistin rhawkaw hae kalan cceih sih,” a cipya. Thuasalama a paaw kha hopah khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul tuh Gibeah khua atelang e Migron khua kya umpaw ccalee ku kaw khe a um; amaw kya umpaw rhawkaw hae tuh za taruh loukaw acih hae, <verse number="3" style="v" />Shiloh khua kya umpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ranpibawi Eli ccapaw Finehas a ccapaw Ikhabod a unopaw Ahitub ccapaw Ahijah tuh ranpibawi angki ccyng zah a umbua. Jonathan a cceih vae cipaw kha ccungccaw hae nynh nyh khyh hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan nynh Filistin rhawkaw hae kalan ccia lan a paccynkunaw laansi kyakhe voi ning mawte chialungsakan hae um zah, ccangkheit min tuh Bozez thua zah, ccangpaw ccangkheit min tuh Seneh nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Chialungsakan ccangkheit tuh thahlang khe Mikmash khua lang hawi zah, ccangpaw ccangkheit tuh alia langkhe Geba khua lang a hawi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jonathan nynh a rhawtuk-uccaw a ccyngtu ccangvaepaw kha, “Rang, khuh-e vingdungawkuh lei hae paw rhawkaw hae kalan cceih sih; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening hanlan rya poh oun lawpah kho; pawccecize ccungccaw alung liate thuasah, azya liate thuasah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> khumnaw kha humhung nynh mah khee kho lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />A rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu nynh, “Na lung nynh a ry hawte cyih ccaleih. Na kya mang ka um; na tuanaw hawte nynh ka tuanaw tuh athuabua,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tetuh Jonathan nynh, “Khuh-e ccungccaw hae kalan ccia lan zah langsapyaku lan hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin nynh, ‘Nae kalan kae thua maw cia oun la ngaw oh,’ a ci hae ze, ah umnaw hmin kya thadyn lan zah minmin kalan ccia lei lan. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama minmin nynh, ‘Kae kalan oun cceih oh,’ a ci hae ze, ccia lan; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha aening kuih kya oun pya vae. Tuh-e tuh aening elang muihsahnaw athua cih,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze parouh mawte Filistin rhawkaw hae kalan khe a langsapyaku hae; te Filistin hae nynh, “Dotua oh, Hebru hae tuh a rekunaw hae akhunaw kyate oun pou vae hae,” a ci hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Rhawkaw hae nynh Jonathan te a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu kha ko hae zah, “Kae kalan rang oh, hankhakheit kae muihsah cih oh,” a cipya hae. Jonathan nynh a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu kha, “Ka nulang te yn zui; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha Israel kuih kalan a pya vae hae,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te Jonathan tuh a kuih a ccu te vawthung zah, a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu nynh a nulang te a zui. Filistin hae tuh Jonathan malang khe khuliakuh hae zah, a nulang te a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu nynh a chia hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Jonathan te a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu nynh masaty a chia hae paw kyatuin, ekah angankuh loukaw akopaw laephi kyakhe, lu kuin loukaw a chia hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ryahmin kya, loo kya te ccungccaw balyn kyakhe siikunaw a um; rhawviatu rhawkaw hae te thiingtu hae heize a thyngkuh hae; innrysuekuh zah siikunaw pipi lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Benjamin ram, Gibeah khua e Saul rhawviatu hae nynh do hae zah, nulang malang phiariphiarae a ccue hae paw Filistin hae kha a muih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul nynh a kya umpaw rhawkaw hae kha, “Milu ria oh, hummou aening kyate a pou, dotua oh,” a cipya hae. Milu a ria hae tuh, Jonathan te a rhawtuk-uccaw ccyngtupaw um vae khyh hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Saul nynh Abijah kha, “Pachia thingkua kha hynhlang yn lah,” a cipya. Pawccecize tuin ccyh lya tuh Pachia thingkua tuh Israel hae kya a cceihbua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Saul nynh ranpibawi a hopya lyakhe, Filistin hae ryahmin kya ngaluin-ngaluin ccaepaw roi tuh houhouh athan; Saul nynh ranpibawi kha, “Na kuih kha sawbung tua,” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Saul te a kya umpaw ccungccaw balyn tuh sueluakuh hae zah rhawtuknaw kalan a cceih hae; Filistin hae tuh mimaw te mimaw thaloi te baekuh hae zah, lungmuanaw pipi a um. <verse number="21" style="v" />Langmaw lyaze Filistin hae kya um hae zah minmin ryte ryahmin kalan a cceihkheih hae paw Hebru hae mah Saul te Jonathan ryte a umkheih hae paw Israel hae kalan maekuh hae zah a umbua vae hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuhawte, Efraim muaram kya a rekuh hae paw Israel hae balyn nynh Filistin hae a ccue vae hae cipaw he a thae hae tuh, rhawtuknaw kya panbua hae zah Filistin hae kha thawte a deehui bua hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuhcite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel kha tuin nin kya taenaw a pya.</para>
  <para style="p">Rhawtuknaw tuh Beth-aven khua khunglang po athua, Saul ryte um hae paw rhawkaw hae tuh ria hae zah mih balynte thong haw loukaw acih hae. Rhawtuknaw tuh Efraim muaram lang cia apazaekuh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Saul nynh Tuaty leite Thyalawnaw A Rae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saul nynh tuin nin khe tuaty leite rya a lawsei. Rhawkaw hae tungvaw thyalawnaw kha rae zah, “Ka rhaw hae kha phu ka law maw hae, zete ccyh athua maw looh a aepaw miakaw tuh thyalawnaw mue sah,” a ci. Tukeiccuze rhawkaw hae tuh looh ae khyh hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Rhawkaw hae balyn nynh khoibu kha thuanua hae zah, laekhu kya khoitui a um. <verse number="26" style="v" />Rhawkaw hae nynh ramkaw a thua hae tuh, khoitui tuh accaw cciamang; thyalawnaw kha a ri hae keiccuze mih kuih kha mih khalang lungkhu lang pukuh khyh hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama a paaw nynh rhawkaw hae kya thyalawnaw bya a hopaw kha Jonathan nynh nyh khyh; tukeiccuze a kuih te a ccyngpaw hoitang dung khate khoidaw kha sua zah a kuih te he a ae tuh a mit a ccaethya hua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Rhawkawpaw lu kheit nynh, “Na paaw nynh rhawkaw hae kha thyalawnaw te tynkaring lan hopah hae zah, ‘Atunin looh aepaw miakaw tuh thyalawnaw mue sah,’ a ci. Tukeiccuze rhawkaw hae tuh mih thawzya vae,” a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tetuh Jonathan nynh, “Ka paaw nynh ram hynh vawsaw a pya; e khoitui ccapyh ka taangtua keiccuze ka mit accaethyapaw hynh dotua oh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Rhawkaw hae nynh mih rhaw hae kya-e luadepaw uccaw kha atunin rythyte a ae hae ze, pawcih baban mou ahoyhua cih; atu tuh Filistin hae kha patae ah theih kho vae khyh oh,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuin nin kya Filistin hae kha Mikmash khua kyate Aijalon khua kyacia a chia hae, rhawkaw hae tuh myarya mih thawzya; <verse number="32" style="v" />tukeiccuze rhawkaw hae nynh luadepaw uccaw kha ccianua hae zah tuu hae, tangnuapaw hae te vaetuataw hae kha lah hae zah laephi kya a theih kou hae te, rhawkaw hae nynh sachii ryte a aede hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Te tuh-e kong tuh Saul kyakhe, “Dotua, rhawkaw hae nynh chiise ryte aede hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya a sei hae,” cite a hopya hae. Te Saul nynh, “Nanning tuh nae lungzi vae khyh; hynhlang ka malang hin lungtungpi ccangkheit oun tou oh,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Gen 9.4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Lev 7.26-27</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 17:10-14">17.10-14</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19.26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Deu 12.16</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:23">23</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15.23</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v" />Saul nynh, “Rhawkaw hae laku lang la cceih oh lah, minmin kyakhe, ‘Ccungccaw balyn nynh mih tangnuapaw khyhze mih tuu kha oun cciakhae hae sah lah, e kyahin theih hae sah lah, ae hae sah; chiise ryte aedete <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya sei nan oh,’ cite hopah oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze tuh-e khuazi khe rhawkaw hae balyn nynh mih tangnuapaw hae kha oun cciakhae hae zah tuin kyakhe a chia hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Te Saul nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan silawhang kha a duapya; tuh-e tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang a duapyapaw masaty silawhang nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jonathan A Chinaw Nae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Te Saul nynh, “Khuazi khe Filistin hae kha deehui oh sih lah, awkhua khuadae cia minmin kha theih oh sih; lu kheit san haang nan oh sih,” a cipya hae. Minmin nynh, “Ahoy na ci hawte cyih ccaleih,” a ci hae. Thuasalama ranpibawi nynh, “E kyahin Pachia kalan naekuh hin oh sih,” a ci. <verse number="37" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Saul nynh Pachia kha ngia zah, “Filistin hae kha ka deehui cih hae tou? Minmin kha Israel hae kuih kalan na pya cih hae tou?” a ci. Thuasalama tuin nin kya Pachia nynh byakhung khyh. <verse number="38" style="v" />Saul nynh, “Ccungccaw cciakhaetu hae balyn, hynhlang rang oh; e seinaw hynh atunin pawtemou yn tho cipaw kha ccungtua oh sih. <verse number="39" style="v" />Pawccecize Israel a khumtu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, tuh-e seinaw tuh ka ccapaw Jonathan tungvaw a um lanze heize, aning tuh a chih ccaccing cih!” a ci. Thuasalama ccungccaw hae balyn laku kya bya a khungrupaw lu kheit san um khyh. <verse number="40" style="v" />Saul nynh Israel hae balyn kyakhe, “Nanning tuh san kheit kya na um cih oh zah, kae te ka ccapaw Jonathan tuh san kheit kya kae um cih,” a cipya hae. Ccungccaw hae nynh Saul kha, “Ahoy na ci hawte cyih ccaleih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="41" style="v" />Te Saul nynh, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia, pawccemou atunin na ryalahtu hynh bya nae khung khyh? E cyiseinaw hynh ka tungvaw thuasah, ka ccapaw Jonathan tungvaw thuasah a um ze, pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia, Urim kha oun pya; thuasalama e cyiseinaw hynh na ccungccaw Israel hae tungvaw a um ze, Thummim kha oun pya,” a ci. Te ccungthydungnaw tuh Jonathan te Saul tungvaw khe ccah zah ccungccaw hae tuh a lue hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Nam 27.21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:6">1Sa 28.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="42" style="v" />Te Saul nynh, “Kae te ka ccapaw Jonathan laku kya ccungthydungnaw kha rae oh,” a ci. Te Jonathan kya accah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tetuh Saul nynh Jonathan kha, “Pawmou na cyisei, yn hopah,” a cipya. Jonathan nynh, “Ka ccyngpaw hoitang dung khate khoitui beihtaraw kha ka taangtua; hein kya mang ka um, ka chih cih,” a cipya. <verse number="44" style="v" />Saul nynh, “Pachia nynh ka tungvaw tuhcite cyih sah lah, tuhlaeze mah cyih vae sah; na chih ccaccing cih, Jonathan!” a cipya. <verse number="45" style="v" />Te ccungccaw hae nynh Saul kha, “Israel tungvaw kya hynh-e taenaw lepaw a raepaw Jonathan tuh tou a chih cih? Tuh-e tuh cyihkuh nan sah! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, a lu kya-e a sangrua ccangkheit sanmah laekhu lang ccah lan khyh; pawccecize aning tuh Pachia ryte atunin rya a lahkheih hae,” a cipya hae. Tuhcite ccungccaw hae nynh Jonathan kha shawkhaw hae zah chih khyh. <verse number="46" style="v" />Te Saul nynh Filistin hae kha deehui leite a kitaw hae; Filistin hae tuh mih umnaw hmin lang a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Saul Rhawtuknaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Saul nynh Israel hae siapharan lang he a tang te, a pepan e a rhaw hae balyn—Moab hae, Ammon hae, Edom hae, Zobah siapharan hae te Filistin hae kha rhaw a tuk hae; rhaw a tuknaw miakaw kya minmin kha a tae hae. <verse number="48" style="v" />Rawthungte rhawtuk zah Amalek hae kha a chia hae, Israel hae kha minmin a luadetu hae kuih kyate a luesah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Saul ccapaw hae tuh Jonathan, Ishvi te Malkhishua nynh thua hae; a ccanung hae lu ning min tuh: atawccanung min tuh Merab cikuh zah, asoihuanung min tuh Mikhal acikuh. <verse number="50" style="v" />Saul a zu min tuh Ahinoam cikuh zah Ahimaaz ccanung nynh thua. A rhawkaw hae bawipaw min tuh Abner cikuh zah Saul a paaw uno Ner ccapaw nynh thua; <verse number="51" style="v" />Saul a paaw tuh Kish thua zah, Abner paaw Ner tuh Abiel ccapaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Saul a hiin lungkhu balyn tuh Filistin hae kha thawte a tuk hae; Saul nynh athawsaepaw te arawthungpaw a muihpaw miakaw kha a rhawkaw lang a khang hae.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Saul nynh Amalek hae Taenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel nynh Saul kha, “A ccungccaw Israel hae uktu siapharan lang tang khylan nang kha chitui thuh lan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae hynh yn saw; tukeiccuze atu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya hynh ngaetua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:1">1Sa 10.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, ‘Israel hae nynh Izip ram kyate a pou lya hae ze, minmin kha rawsete a doutu Amalek kha de ka tah cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:8-14">Exo 17.8-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 25:17-19">Deu 25.17-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Atu la cceih lah, Amalek kha la tuk, mih hoipaw balyn kha khaleih la roh; minmin kha haang nan hae, nopi te pise, imua te nosi, tangnuapaw te tuu, kalauh te lann kha theih hae,’ a ci,” cite a hopya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Saul nynh ccungccaw hae kha pum hae zah Telaim khua khe milu a ria hae, ccu rhawkaw cciing ning, Judah rhawkaw hae thong haw acih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul tuh Amalek hae khua kya thua zah accya khe a buh hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul nynh Ken ccungccaw hae kha, “Cceih oh! Pou oh! Amalek hae kyate la cceih oh, minmin ryte kae rohbia sei cih oh; pawccecize Israel hae nynh Izip ram kyate a pou lya hae ze, minmin kha ngaethya na umsah oh,” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze Ken ccungccaw hae tuh Amalek hae kyate a pou hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Saul nynh Amalek hae kha Havilah khua kyate Izip nithua lang umpaw Shur khua kyacia a tae hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Amalek siapharan Agag kha a hiin te a kyng, thuasalama ccungccaw balyn kha tuh thaloi te khaleih a ro hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul te ccungccaw hae nynh Agag te ahoy huaccepaw tuu, vaetua, athopaw tuutaw te ahoypaw uccaw balyn kha khaleih ro leite a haang hae; anyaapaw te ccungkia leipaw balyn kha tuh khaleih a ro hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Saul kha Siapharan kyate Vuanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Samuel kalan yn thua zah: <verse number="11" style="v" />“Saul kha siapharan lang ka la khangpaw tuh ka ngaesikuh, pawccecize kamaw zuinaw kyate maeleihkuh zah, kaw ka pya hae paw kha zui khyh,” a ci. Samuel tuh a thinria zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan azi zidae a sia. <verse number="12" style="v" />Samuel tuh Saul te tungku khylan awkhua takaw te tho zah a cceih, te Samuel kyakhe, “Saul tuh Karmel khua lang cceih zah, ning leinawpaw lungbing kha a bingku, te po sulue zah Gilgal khua lang a cceih,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Samuel nynh Saul kalan he a thua te, Saul nynh amaw kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythua ae pya vae sah; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw yn pya thyhte ka cyi vae,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama Samuel nynh, “Athua lanze, ka naw te ka thaepaw tuu a siapaw roi te vaetua a siapaw roi tuh pawmou athua?” a cipya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul nynh, “Amalek hae kyate oun thuakhae hae paw nynh thua; pawccecize ccungccaw hae nynh ahoy huaccepaw tuu te vaetua kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kalan silaw nawlan a haang hae; tuhlaepaw kha tuh khaleih kae ro,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te Samuel nynh Saul kha, “Zya dae! Atazi <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn hopyapaw kha kae hopah cih,” a cipya. Aning nynh, “Hotua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Samuel nynh, “Namaw na tuanaw kya adihpaw na thua zemah, nang tuh Israel minphuin hae lu na thua khyh tou? <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel siapharan lang chitui ae thuh. <verse number="18" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh rya ccangkheit law lan ae saw zah, ‘La cceih lah, misei hae, Amalek hae kha marya la roh hae, maemih athua mawlaezung hae la tuk hae,’ a ci. <verse number="19" style="v" />Athua lanze, pawccemou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha na ngae khyh? Pawccemou rhaw hae kya-e luadepaw uccaw kha na lah kangmaw zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya hoyleinaw kha na rae?” a cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Saul nynh Samuel kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha ka ngae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn sawnuathepaw ryalaw kha ka ccianua, Amalek siapharan Agag kha ka thuakhae zah, Amalek hae kha marya ka ro hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama luadepaw uccaw kya-e tuu te vaetua, ro lanpaw uccaw hae kya-e ahoy huaccepaw kha Gigal khua kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kalan silaw nawlan cite ccungccaw hae nynh a law hae,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te Samuel nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya zuinaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya a lungrythua hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">maee-ute silawnaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpaw silawnaw hae kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh myarya</para>
  <para style="q2">a lungrythua cih tou?</para>
  <para style="q1">Thanccingte, kawngaenaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">silawnaw laeze ahoyhua,</para>
  <para style="q1">bya zuinaw tuh tuutepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">atho laeze ahoyhua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawccecize kaw-einaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">pawepaw hawte seinaw le zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">lungkhungnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">hoyleinaw te zohtuh</para>
  <para style="q2">beiknaw hawte seinaw ale.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha</para>
  <para style="q2">na vua vae keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q1">nang kha siapharan thuanaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">ae vua vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Saul nynh Samuel kha, “Ka sei vae; ccungccaw hae kha ka rih hae zah mih bya ka ngae keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawbya te na bya kha ka eisei vae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu, ka seinaw yn ngaethya lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ka beik ccaw, kamaw te kikheih sih, cite kae ngiaku,” a cipya. <verse number="26" style="v" />Samuel nynh Saul kha, “Nang te kikheih lei lan; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha na vua zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha Israel siapharan thuanaw kyate ae vua vae,” a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Samuel nynh ccia lan vae cite a maeleihku lyakhe, Saul nynh a boei dung apaki kha kyng zah thoh seiikuh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.27-28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 28:17">1Sa 28.17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:30-31">1Si 11.30-31</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />Te Samuel nynh Saul kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel peenaw kha na kyate atunin ccaccei hin thoh seii vae zah, nang laeze ahoy huapaw na innpaw kalan a pya vae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tuhpiaze, Israel Phu-enaw Pachia nynh tuh hynbya ho lan khyh zah a tuanaw mah paleihkuh lan khyh, aning tuh ccungccaw thua khyh zah a tuanaw mah paleihkuh lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Te Saul nynh, “Ka sei vae; tuhzemah ka ccungccaw hae kya-e piccan hae malang te Israel hae malang kya sawtuanaw yn pya lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia kha ka beik ccaw, kamaw te kikheih sih,” a cipya. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Samuel tuh Saul nulang a zuikuh; te Saul nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a beik.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tetuh Samuel nynh, “Amalek hae siapharan Agag kha hynhlang ka kalan yn cciakhae oh,” a ci. Te Agag tuh rarymamaw lante Samuel kalan a cceih. Agag nynh, “Thanccingte, e hynh myarya ccihpaw chinaw nynh thua,” a ci. <verse number="33" style="v" />Thuasalama Samuel nynh,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Na thaloi nynh nopi hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaaw leite a nung hae hawte,</para>
  <para style="q1">na nung tuh nopi hae kyaze</para>
  <para style="q2">ccaaw leite a um cih,”</para>
  <para style="m">a cipya. Te Samuel nynh Agag kha Gilgal khua <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe zoihtatyh lan a bae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Te Samuel tuh Ramah khua lang a cceih; Saul tuh Gibeah khua kya umpaw amaw inn lang a cceih. <verse number="35" style="v" />Samuel nynh Saul kha a chi makhia muih vae khyh, thuasalama Samuel tuh Saul elang a ngaethah. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Saul kha Israel siapharan lang a la khang keiccuze a ngaesikuh.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Siapharan lang David Chitui Thuhnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Samuel kha, “Hohseciamou Saul elang na ngaethah cih? Israel hae kya siapharan thuanaw kyate aning kha ka vua vae. Na saki kya chitui ruinkuh lah, cciatua; nang kha Bethlehem khuapaw Jesse kalan kae saw cih, pawccecize a ccapaw hae kyakhe kamaw elang siapharan lu kheit kha ka paccyn vae,” a cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Samuel nynh, “Pawtemou ka cceih kho cih? Saul nynh tuh-e tuh a thae ze, yn theih cih,” a ci. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Vaetua tohlaw sa kheit kha cciakhae lah, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan silaw lan kae thua vae,’ cite na ho cih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Silaw lan Jesse kha ko lah, na cyi lanpaw kha kae muihsah cih; a min kae hopyapaw kha kamaw elang nang nynh chitui na thuh cih,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kaw a pya thyhte Samuel nynh cyih zah, Bethlehem khua lang a cceih. Khua kya-e piccan hae tuh amaw kha tungku khylan thyngkute oun thua hae zah, “Daenaw lante tou nae thua?” a ci hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Samuel nynh, “Daenaw lante; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan silaw khylan kae thua vae; thyaasakuh oh lah, silaw lan ka kya cceihbua oh,” a cipya hae. Jesse te a ccapaw hae kha thyaasah hae zah silawnaw kalan a ko hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He a thua hae te, Eliab kha do zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e chitui thuh athuapaw tuh atu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang a umpaw hynh nynh athua ccaccing,” cite a tua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Samuel kha, “A muinsan te a pynrua ahangpaw kha do nan, pawccecize amaw kha ka vua vae; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuh ccungccaw nynh do hawte do khyh; ccungccaw nynh tuh atolang e muinsan kha a do, thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuh thinlung kha a do,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Jesse nynh Abinadab kha ko zah Samuel malang khe a cciasah. Samuel nynh, “E paw hynh mah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a popaw thua khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te Jesse nynh Shammah kha cciasah zah, Samuel nynh, “E paw hynh mah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a popaw thua khyh,” a ci. <verse number="10" style="v" />Jesse nynh a ccapaw hae lu sari kha Samuel malang cciasah hae zah, Samuel nynh Jesse kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynh-e hae hynh lu kheit sanmah po khyh hae,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Samuel nynh Jesse kha, “Hein kya na ccapaw hae mih balynte a um hae tou?” cite a khia. Jesse nynh, “Asoi huapaw a um ung, thuasalama aning tuh tuu a rin,” a cipya. Te Samuel nynh Jesse kha, “Ccungccaw saw lah, amaw kha kosah hae; aning yn thua mawlaezung hein kya haung lei lan,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesse nynh saw hae zah aning kha a thuakhae hae. Aning tuh a ngesaw selalyng lan cih zah, a mitdae puithya zah a puithyapaw nynh thua. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Thokuh lah, amaw kha chitui thuh; pawccecize hynh-e paw hynh nynh athua,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Samuel nynh chitui ruinkuhpaw saki kha lah zah, a uno hae malang khe chitui a thuh; tuin nin te vae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh David tungvaw kya thawmawte a thua. Samuel tuh thokuh zah Ramah khua lang a cceih.</para>
  <para style="s1">David nynh Saul Tintang A Khuapya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muisaw tuh Saul kyate pou zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate yn thuapaw muisaw hoyleipaw nynh aning kha vawsaw a pya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul a ryalahtu hae nynh Saul kha, “Dotua, Pachia kyate yn thuapaw muisaw hoyleipaw nynh nang kha vawsaw ae pya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Ae do-oihtu hae paw na ryalahtu hae nynh tintang a khuathyapaw kha kae ccung nawlan kaw oun pyatua; Pachia kyate yn thuapaw muisaw hoyleipaw nynh he ae thuanua ze, aning nynh tintang ae khuapah cih zah na dan cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Saul nynh a ryalahtu hae kha, “Tintang hoyte a khuathyapaw kha yn ccungpah oh lah, yn thuakhaepah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Ccangvaepaw lu kheit nynh, “Bethlehem khuapaw Jesse ccapaw tuh tintang a khuathya, a rawthung, rhawtuk a thya, byahonaw kya haw zah a puithya; te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a kya a um,” a ci. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Saul nynh Jesse kalan locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, “Tuu a rinpaw na ccapaw David kha ka kalan yn saw,” cite bya a taw. <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesse nynh sanlou phupaw lann sa kheit, misutui kha saving tui-ung ccangkheit, miaataw sa kheit kha lah zah a ccapaw David kyate Saul kalan a ky. <verse number="21" style="v" />David tuh Saul kya thua zah, a ryalaw kya a tee. Saul nynh myarya sungsah zah, a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu lang a tang. <verse number="22" style="v" />Saul nynh Jesse kalan ccungccaw saw zah, “David tuh ka malang maehoynaw a ccou keiccuze ka ryalaw kya um sah,” cite bya a taw. <verse number="23" style="v" />Pachia kyate yn thuapaw muisaw hoyleipaw nynh Saul kha a thuanua takyh vae ze, David nynh tintang kha lawkuh zah a kuih te a khua; tetuh Saul tuh hoyhua zah leih a dan, te muisaw hoyleipaw tuh a kyate leih a pou.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David te Goliath</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh mih rhawkaw hae kha rhawtuk lan Judah ram Sokoh khua kya a pum hae; Sokoh te Azekah laku umpaw Efes-dammim kya a rya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Saul te Israel hae tuh sueluakute Elah accya kya rya hae zah, Filistin hae kha dou khylan paccynkute a um hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Filistin hae tuh accya voikheit lang raw e mua vawlan khe thadyn hae zah, Israel hae tuh accya voikheih lang raw e mua vawlan khe a thadyn hae, mih laku khe accya a um. <verse number="4" style="v" />Dong taruh te khaw ning hang zah myarya thungpaw, Gath khuapaw Goliath cikuhpaw tuh Filistin hae ryahmin kyate yn pou. <verse number="5" style="v" />A lu kya sohin lukhung khungkuh zah sohin shekel thong pangaw aripaw sivaw angki kha a kiku. <verse number="6" style="v" />A ccu kya sohin mawccae nawkuh zah a raw hae laku kya sohin ccoi kha a vawku. <verse number="7" style="v" />A ccoi alua tuh phaeccya cia cih zah, a ccoi dung kya-e sivaw tuh shekel za taruh ari; a khawriaphua ccyngtu tuh a malang khe a cceih. <verse number="8" style="v" />Goliath nynh thadyn zah Israel rhawkaw hae kha o hae zah, “Nanning nynh pawccemou rhawtukku lan nae pou oh? Kae tuh Filistin ccungccaw ka thua zah, nanning tuh Saul ryalahtu hae na thua khyh oh tou? Naemaw hanlan ccungccaw lu kheit oun po oh lah, ka kalan yn cceihbung sah. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha yn tae zah yn chia kho ze, kaening tuh nae ryalahtu lang kae tang cih; thuasalama kae nynh ka tae zah ka chia ze, nanning tuh kae ryalahtu lang na tang cih oh zah kae rya na lah cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e Filistin paw nynh, “Atunin kya Israel rhawkaw hae kha tukku lan kae hyy oh! Ccungccaw lu kheit oun po oh lah, kae tukku tua cih,” a ci. <verse number="11" style="v" />Filistin paw bya kha Saul te Israel hae balyn nynh a thae hae tuh, mih bungzou zah myarya a rih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David tuh Judah ram Bethlehem khua e Efrath phin Jesse ccapaw nynh thua, Jesse tuh ccapaw lu tarya a hoi. Saul she lyakhe tuh-e ccungccapaw tuh taw vae zah a kum tang vae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesse ccapaw hae kya-e atawccaw hae lu thum nynh rhawtuknaw kalan Saul kha a zui hae; rhawtuknaw kalan a cceih hae paw Jesse ccapaw lu thum hae min tuh ccatawccaw Eliab, a zuitu Abinadab te lu thumnaw Shammah nynh thua hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />David tuh asoi huapaw nynh thua; atawccaw hae lu thum nynh Saul kha a zui hae, <verse number="15" style="v" />thuasalama David tuh Bethlehem kya a paaw tuu kha rin khylan Saul kyate a ki. <verse number="16" style="v" />Filistin paw nynh nin sung pali lungkhu awkhua takyh zete takyh pounua hae zah a thadynnua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jesse nynh a ccapaw David kha, “Na upaw hae hanlan hynh-e vae-u ephah ccangkheit te sanlou ccanghaw hynh lah lah, ryahmin lang na u hae kalan khe arangte la cciakhae; <verse number="18" style="v" />te rhawkaw thong kheit uktu mih rhawbawipaw hanlan vaetua mateitui ahaawpaw ccanghaw kha mah la phubia. Na upaw hae tuh la viatua hae lah, minmin kyate a dan hae cinawpaw muihsahnaw ccangkhakheit nae ccyng cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Saul te David a upaw hae te Israel hae balyn tuh Elah accya kyakhe Filistin hae ryte rhaw a tukkuh hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />David tuh awkhua takaw te tho zah tuu hae kha tuurinpaw kya cciataw hae zah Jesse nynh a naw thyhte, looh kha ccyngbia zah a cceih. Rhawkaw hae tuh siarua biate rhawtuknaw hmin lang a ccia lya hae khe David tuh ryahmin kya a thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Israel rhawkaw hae te Filistin rhawkaw hae tuh tukku khylan rawsekute a um hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />David nynh uccaw kha uccaw a rintu kyakhe a nungsya koute rhawkaw hae kalan ccue zah a upaw hae kha bya a beih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Minmin ryte bya a hoku lya hae khe, myarya thungpaw Filistin ccungccapaw, Gath khuapaw Goliath cikuhpaw tuh Filistin rhawkaw hae kyate yn pou zah, langmaw a homaepaw bya kha a ho. David nynh a bya kha a thae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Israel hae balyn nynh tuh-e paw kha a muih hae tuh, myarya rih hae zah a ccue hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel hae nynh, “Khuh-e ccungccapaw yn poupaw khuh na muih oh tou? Thanccingte Israel kha theihrya khylan nynh yn pou. Amaw a theihpaw kha siapharan nynh sisua patae a pya cih, a ccanung kha a pya cih zah a paaw innbyn kha Israel ram kya ngunto a luesah cih,” a ci hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />David nynh a pe a thadyn hae paw kyakhe, “E Filistin paw hynh theih zah Israel kha maethyanaw kyate a luesahpaw tuh pawmou cyipya athua cih? Ahiinpaw Pachia rhawkaw hae kha theihrya lan ciate vingdungawkuh leipaw hynh-e Filistin paw hynh hummou athua?” a cipya hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuh-e ccungccaw hae nynh, “Amaw a theihpaw kha tuhcite cyipya athua cih,” cite atakaw lya-e bya kha a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />David nynh minmin a hopya hae paw kha a upaw atawccapaw Eliab nynh a thae tuh, David tungvaw a thinria zah, “Pawccemou hynhlang nae ccia? Beihtarawpaw ka tuu kha ramkaw kya humkyamou nae cciataw? Na lysakunaw te na thinlung a hoyleinaw kha phe ka ny; rhawtuk do khylan nynh nae cciabung,” a cipya. <verse number="29" style="v" />David nynh, “Pawmou ka cyisei? Bya kaw kheit rou khaw ka khia,” a cipya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuh-e paw kyate ccangpaw lu kheit kalan maekuh zah a homae hawte a hopya; ccungccaw hae nynh atakaw lya hawte bua a khung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />David nynh a hopaw bya kha a thae hae tuh, Saul kha a hopya pathy hae; te aning nynh David kha a ko. <verse number="32" style="v" />David nynh Saul kha, “Aning keiccuze humhung mah a lungthang nan sah; na ryalahtupaw nynh ka cceih cih zah, e Filistin paw hynh ka tuk cih,” a cipya. <verse number="33" style="v" />Saul nynh David kha, “Nang nynh e Filistin paw hynh tuk lan na ccianua kho lan khyh; pawccecize nang tuh imua na thua ung zah, aning tuh a ccangvae takaw lya mawte rhawkaw lang a tang vae,” a cipya. <verse number="34" style="v" />Thuasalama David nynh Saul kha, “Na ryalahtupaw nynh ka paaw hanlan tuu leih ka rin zah, chindeih khyhze vong yn thua zah tuuphu kya-e tuutaw kha a tei ze, <verse number="35" style="v" />ka deehui zah ka theih koute a khalang lungkhu e tuutaw kha leih ka luesah; chindeih khyhze vong nynh yn zounua ze, a khaw te leih ka kyng zah ka bua zah ka chia. <verse number="36" style="v" />Na ryalahtupaw nynh chindeih te vong kha parouh mawte ka chia hae; e vingdungawkuh leipaw Filistin paw hynh ahiinpaw Pachia rhawkaw hae kha a theihrya hae keiccuze tuh-e loramsaw hae kya-e sa kheit hawte athua cih,” a cipya. <verse number="37" style="v" />David nynh, “Chindeih ccutin te vong ccutin kyate yn khumpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh e Filistin paw kuih kyate yn khum cih,” a ci. Tukeiccuze Saul nynh David kha, “La cceih, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae umkhae vae sah!” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Saul nynh David kha a rhawtuk-uccaw a lawsahku; sohin lukhung kha a lu kya khungsah zah sivaw angki kha a kisah. <verse number="39" style="v" />David nynh Saul thaloi kha rhawtuk-uccaw vawlan khe khangkuh zah ccia lan zuaku tua zah cceih kho khyh; pawccecize tuh-e uccaw hae tuh lawkuh boi khyh. Tetuh David nynh Saul kha, “E hae ryte tuh ka cceih kho khyh; pawccecize e hae hynh ka lawkuh boi khyh,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze David nynh tuh-e uccaw hae tuh a khahku. <verse number="40" style="v" />Te David nynh a hoitang kha ccyngkuh zah vawkhu e naebabingpaw lungpyng ccangpangaw kha pokuh zah, a tuurin uccaw athuapaw a zaw lungkhu khe a sangku; a zae kha a kuih te ccyngkuh zah Filistin paw kha a naenuaku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Filistin paw nynh David kha naenuakuh zah a khawriaphua ccyngtu tuh a malang khe a cceih. <verse number="42" style="v" />Filistin paw nynh do zah David kha a muih tuh a theihrya, pawccecize aning tuh ccangvae taraw thua zah, a ngesaw selalyng lan cih zah a puithya. <verse number="43" style="v" />Filistin paw nynh David kha, “Kae tuh ui tou ka thua, ccungngue te nae ccianua?” a cipya. A pachia hae min phyate David kha thya a law. <verse number="44" style="v" />Filistin paw nynh David kha, “Ka kalan yn cceih, na saw kha azouthyapaw pavaw hae te laephi kya-e sarepaw hae kalan ka pya cih hae,” a ci. <verse number="45" style="v" />Thuasalama David nynh Filistin paw kha, “Nang nynh thaloi, ccoi te ccoi dihpaw khate nae ccianua; thuasalama kae nynh tuh nang nynh na theihryapaw vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel rhawkaw hae Pachia min te kae ccianua. <verse number="46" style="v" />Atunin ccaccei kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha ka kuih kalan yn pya cih, nang kha kae theih cih zah na lu kae pae cih; te Filistin rhawkaw hae rhua kha azouthyapaw pavaw hae te laephi kya-e sarepaw hae kalan atunin ccaccei kya ka pya cih hae, tetuh laephi pynpi nynh Israel hae kya Pachia a um cipaw kha a nyh cih hae. <verse number="47" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thaloi te ccoi khate khum khyh hae cipaw kha e zapi hae balyn nynh a nyh cih hae; pawccecize rhawtuknaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e thua zah aning nynh nanning kha kae kuih kalan oun pya cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Filistin paw nynh David kha tungku khylan he a naenuakuh tuh, David nynh mah Filistin paw te tungku khylan rhawkaw hae kalan khe arangte a ccue. <verse number="49" style="v" />David nynh a zaw lungkhu lang a kuih pu zah lung ccangkheit kha thuaakute henuanawpaw zae te henua zah Filistin paw tuh a terui kya a tung; lung tuh a terui lungkhu lang po sungkuh zah laekhu kya a mae lante a khuliakuh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tuhcite David nynh Filistin paw kha henuanawpaw zae te lung ccangkheit khate tae zah Filistin paw kha tungsah zah a chia; David kuih kya thaloi um khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:19">2Sa 21.19</ref></char></note> <verse number="51" style="v" />Tetuh David nynh ccuenua zah Filistin paw vawlan khe a thadyn; a thaloi kha abu kyate poh thuaa zah a chia; tuh-e thaloi te a lu kha a pae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:9">1Sa 21.9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">Filistin hae nynh athung huapaw mih ccungccapaw a chih vae cipaw a muih hae tuh, a ccue hae. <verse number="52" style="v" />Israel te Judah rhawkaw hae tuh sia biate thokuh hae zah Filistin hae kha Gath te Ekron koikua kyacia a dee hae, vaemaw muepaw Filistin hae tuh Shaaraim kyate Gath te Ekron kyacia laanpi kya po a khuliakuh hae. <verse number="53" style="v" />Israel hae tuh Filistin hae a deehuinaw hae kyate oun ki hae zah, mih ryahmin kha a law hae. <verse number="54" style="v" />David nynh Filistin paw lu kha lah zah Jerusalem lang a cciakhae; a rhawtuk-uccaw kha tuh a bu kya a nungsya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />David nynh Filistin paw a ccianuapaw kha Saul nynh a muih tuh, rhawbawipaw Abner kyakhe, “Abner, e ccangvaepaw hynh hum ccapaw mou athua?” cite khia zah, Abner nynh, “Pou siapharan, nang tuh na hiin thyhte, aning kha ka nyh khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="56" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Ccangvaepaw kha hum ccapaw mou athua, khiatua oh,” a ci. <verse number="57" style="v" />David tuh Filistin paw a chianaw kyate he yn ki tuh, Abner nynh aning kha ko zah Filistin paw lu kha a kuih te ccyng biate Saul malang a thuakhae. <verse number="58" style="v" />Saul nynh, “Ccangvaepaw, hum ccapaw mou na thua?” cite a khia. David nynh, “Bethlehem khuapaw na ryalahpaw Jesse ccapaw nynh ka thua,” a cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David te Jonathan Byakinkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nynh Saul kha bya he a hopah kou tuh, Jonathan thinlung tuh David thinlung kyakhe lungde thua zah, Jonathan nynh David kha amaw toulou hawte a sungsah. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuin nin khe Saul nynh David kha lawkuh zah a paaw inn lang ki lan ua vae khyh. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jonathan nynh David kha amaw toulou hawte a sungsah keiccuze David ryte byakinnaw a rae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan nynh a kikupaw boeining kha khahkuh zah a rhawtuk-uccaw, a thaloi, a li te a taeccia ryte David kha a pya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul nynh a sawnaw takyh kya David tuh a laan a sui a ua; tukeiccuze Saul nynh aning kha rhawkaw hae uktu lang a nung. Ccungccaw hae balyn nynh thuasah, Saul a ryalahtu hae nynh heize thuasah David kha mih naw accah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Inn lang a ki lya hae khe, David tuh Filistin paw a chianaw kyate yn ki lyakhe nopi hae tuh Saul Siapharan kha cciadue khylan hlawsahte, law biate, tyng te lungtuanaw hlawsahte, khuakupaw aphuinphuin kha khuakute Israel khua hae balyn kyate oun pou hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nopi hae nynh lungpawnaw a rae lya hae khe,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Saul nynh athong thong te,</para>
  <para style="q2">David nynh accong ccong te</para>
  <para style="q1">a chia hae,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite liakute hlaw a sah hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:11">1Sa 21.11</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 29:5">29.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Saul tuh a thin myarya ria, pawccecize tuh-e bya nynh a lunghoysah khyh. Aning nynh, “David tuh athong-asan te a theih cite tua hae zah, kae tuh athong thong a theih cite yn tua hae; aning nynh peenaw laelan pawmou a hoi kho ung?” a ci. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuin nin te vae tuh Saul nynh David kha lunghiinnaw mit te a do-ih vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">David Chia lan Saul Zuakunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Awkhualan khe Pachia kyate yn thuapaw muisaw hoyleipaw nynh Saul kha thuanua zah, a inn lungkhu khe lungmuanaw bya kha a ho, tuh ccyh lya tuh David tuh nin takyhte tintang leih a khua hawte a khua cciamang. Saul nynh a ccoi kha a kuih kya a ccyngku; <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul nynh, “David kha pang kya ka bing cih,” cite tua zah ccoi te khoih salamah David nynh vae ning a lingku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Saul kha poutaw zah David kya a um keiccuze Saul nynh David kha a ripya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Saul nynh a kyate David kha nue zah thong kheit uktu rhawbawi lang a nung, te rhawkaw hae malang khe leih pou zah leih a tee. <verse number="14" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a kya a um keiccuze David tuh a ryalaw miakaw kya a laan a sui a ua. <verse number="15" style="v" />David tuh a laan a sui myarya ua cipaw kha Saul nynh a muih tuh, Saul tuh houh a rih vae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae te Judah hae balyn nynh David kha a sungsah hae; pawccecize David tuh mih malang khe a pou a tee bungthungpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">David te Mikhal Zuvaw Tang hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Saul nynh David kha, “Hein kya ka ccanung atawccaw huapaw Merab a um; aning kha na zu lang kae pya cih; ka hanlan na rawthung sah lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rhawtuknaw kha tuktua,” a cipya. Pawccecize Saul nynh, “Kamaw nynh ka kuih ka hangnua lan khyh, Filistin hae nynh aning kha theih hae sah,” cite a tua. <verse number="18" style="v" />David nynh Saul kha, “Kae tuh siapharan a paeepaw lang tang lan ciate hummou ka thua? Ka puizia hae te ka paaw innbyn tuh Israel ram kya hummou athua hae?” a cipya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuasalama Saul ccanung Merab tuh David kalan pya lan accan ccyh lyakhe, Meholah khuapaw Adriel zu lang a pya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Saul ccanung Mikhal nynh David kha a sungsah. Tuh-e tuh Saul kha hopah hae zah a lungrythua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul nynh, “Mikhal tuh aning hanlan kaang athua nawlan te Filistin hae kuih nynh aning kha a rawse nawlan, aning kha ka pya sah,” cite a tuaku. Tukeiccuze Saul nynh David kha vae ningnaw hopah zah, “Ka paeepaw lang na tang cih,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Saul nynh a ryalahtu hae kyakhe, “David kyakhe aphiruh lante, ‘Dotua, siapharan tuh na tungvaw lungtuanaw a hoi, a ryalahtu hae balyn nynh mah ae sungsah hae; tukeiccuze siapharan paeepaw lang tang ccavae,’ cite la hopah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Saul a ryalahtu hae nynh tuh-e bya tuh David kha zya a hopya hae. David nynh, “Kae tuh a ryachipaw te sawtuanaw a ccou leipaw ka thuapaw hynh do oh lah, siapharan paeepaw lang tang lanpaw tuh azoipaw lang tou na ria oh?” a cipya hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />Saul a ryalahtu hae nynh, “David nynh hynhte nynh aho,” cite Saul kha a hopya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tetuh Saul nynh, “David kha hynhte la hopah oh, ‘Siapharan nynh a rhaw hae tungvaw phulawnaw lante, Filistin hae vingdung za kheit laelan, ccangpaw kha a ccanung mee lang ry khyh,’ la cipah oh,” a cipya hae. Saul nynh David tuh Filistin hae kuih te chisah lan a paccyn. <verse number="26" style="v" />Saul a ryalahtu hae nynh tuh-e bya tuh David kya he a hopah hae tuh, David tuh siapharan paeepaw lang tang lan myarya a lungrythua. Accyh alawe mawkhe, <verse number="27" style="v" />David tuh a ccungccaw hae ryte thokute cceih hae zah Filistin hae za kheit kha a chia hae; David nynh mih vingdung tuh cciakhae zah siapharan paeepaw lang tang khylan siapharan kalan phe ccing lan a pya. Saul nynh a ccanung Mikhal tuh David kalan zu lang a pya. <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawipaw tuh David kya a um cipaw te a ccanung Mikhal nynh David a sungsah cipaw kha Saul nynh he a nyh tuh, <verse number="29" style="v" />David kha houh a rih vae. Tukeiccuze tuin ccyh kyate vae tuh Saul tuh David rhaw lang a tang vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Filistin rhawbawi hae tuh rhawtuknaw kalan atu te atu oun pou hae; David tuh Saul a ryalahtu hae balyn laeze taenaw a muehua, tukeiccuze a minthaannaw tuh houhouh ale.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jonathan nynh David A Pankhae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul nynh David chia lanpaw kong kha a ccapaw Jonathan te a ryalahtu hae kyakhe a hopya hae. Thuasalama Saul ccapaw Jonathan nynh David kha myarya a sungsah. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jonathan nynh David kha, “Ka paaw Saul nynh nang kha chia lan a paccynku; tukeiccuze awkhualan awkhua kya raeringkuh; muih kho leinaw hmin kya um lah reku tua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka cceih cih zah na umnaw loo kya ka paaw pe khe ka thadyn cih, te ka paaw kyakhe na konglang kha ka hopah cih; ka nypaw hankhakheit a um ze kae hopah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan nynh a paaw Saul kyakhe David a hoynaw kong kha hopah zah, “Siapharan nynh a ryalahpaw David tungvaw seinaw rae nan sah, pawccecize aning nynh na tungvaw sei khyh, rya a lawpaw hynh na hanlan ahoypaw cci nynh thua; <verse number="5" style="v" />a hiinnaw duaaku leite Filistin paw kha theih zah, Israel hae balyn hanlan myarya lepaw taenaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a rae. Tuh-e tuh na muih zah na lungtua; tukeiccuze akonglang um leite David kha chiate, seinaw a hoi leipaw ccungccaw tungvaw kya pawccemou seinaw na rae lanpaw tuh?” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul nynh Jonathan bya tuh ngae zah, Saul nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, aning tuh chia thua lan khyh,” cite thyalawkute bya a kinku. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Jonathan nynh David kha ko zah hynh-e konglang balyn kha a hopya. Te Jonathan nynh David kha Saul kalan cciakhae zah, langmaw hawte a kyakhe bua a um.</para>
  <para style="s1">Mikhal nynh David A Bawm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Rhawtuknaw bua um zah David tuh Filistin hae kha tuk khylan a cceih. Aning nynh patae a chia hae keiccuze minmin tuh amaw malang te a ccue hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul tuh a ccoi ccyngkute a inn lungkhu a haung lyakhe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kyate yn thuapaw muisaw hoyleipaw tuh a tungvaw a thua; tuh ccyh lyakhe David tuh tintang palei a khua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul nynh David kha pang kya phang bingkuh lan ccoi te khoih lan a ccung; thuasalama Saul kha a lingku mang, tukeiccuze ccoi tuh pang kya a bingkuh. David tuh ccue zah, tuh-e khuazi kya phe a lue.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Saul nynh David kha awkhua khe chia lan paccyn zah, David kha ngaw khylan a inn langkhe locceihtu hae kha a sawnua hae. David zu Mikhal nynh amaw kha, “Atu khuazi kya na hiinnaw kha na khumku khyh ze, awkhualan tuh chia na thua cih,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 59">Sam 59</ref> (Abyalu)</char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Mikhal nynh David kha thanlan-aw kyate rungsah bung zah, aning tuh ccue zah a lue. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mikhal nynh zohtuh ccangkheit kha lah zah a ikhung vawlan a nung; miaa ming te kuakuhpaw boei te a lu kha bong zah boei a thy. <verse number="14" style="v" />Saul nynh David ko lan locceihtu hae kha he a saw hae tuh, Mikhal nynh, “David a ccih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Saul nynh David do khylan locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, “Aning kha ka chia ccaw, ikhung ryte ka kalan oun cciakhae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Locceihtu hae nynh he a tee hae tuh, miaa ming te kuakuhpaw boei te a lu bong hae paw zohtuh tuh ikhung vawlan khe a la um. <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul nynh Mikhal kha, “Pawccemou hynhte nae ling zah, ka rhawpaw tuh a lue ccaw cite na cciasah?” a cipya. Mikhal nynh Saul kha, “Aning nynh kae kha, ‘Yn ccia sah, tuhkhyhze nang kha kae theih cih,’ yn ci,” cite a hopya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ramah kya David te Samuel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhcite David tuh ccue zah a lue; Ramah khua umpaw Samuel kalan cceih zah, Saul nynh a tungvaw a cyipaw balyn kha a hopya. Aning te Samuel tuh cceih hae zah Naioth khua kya a um hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />“David tuh Ramah khua pe Naioth khua kya nynh a um,” cite Saul kha a hopya hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tetuh David kyng khylan Saul nynh locceihtu hae kha a saw hae. Profeh hae phu kya Samuel tuh lupi lang umte profehbya a ho cciamang hae paw kha locceihtu hae nynh he a muih hae tuh, Pachia muisaw tuh Saul a locceihtu hae tungvaw kya yn thua zah, minmin mah profehbya a hobua hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuh-e kong tuh Saul kha he a hopah hae tuh, ccangpaw locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, tuh-e hae mah profehbya a hobua hae. Saul nynh vae thumnaw locceihtu hae kha saw hae zah, tuh-e hae mah profehbya a hobua hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tetuh amaw ccaccei tuh Ramah khua lang a cceih. Seku khua kya umpaw tuisung pi kya he a thua te, “Samuel te David tuh teimou a um hae?” cite a khia hae. Te lukheitpaw nynh, “Ramah khua pe e Naioth khua kya nynh a um hae,” a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te Ramah khua pe e Naioth khua langkhe cceih zah, Pachia muisaw tuh Saul tungvaw yn thua. A ccia cciamang lyakhe, Ramah khua pe e Naioth khua a thua mawlaezung profehbya po a ho. <verse number="24" style="v" />A boeining kha khahkuh zah Samuel malang khe profehbya a ho. Tuh-e nin ninlang te tuh-e khuazi zidae tuh a ccakaete a huekuh. Tukeiccuze, “Saul mah profeh lang a tangbua vae tou?” cite leih a ho hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:11-12">1Sa 10.11-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David te Jonathan Ruiban Tangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David tuh Ramah khua pe e Naioth khua kyate a ccue, te Jonathan kya thua zah, “Pawmou ka cyi? Ka cyiseinaw pawmou a um? Na paaw nynh ka hiinnaw law lan a zuakupaw hynh a tungvaw pawmou ka sei?” a cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Jonathan nynh, “Tuh-e tuh cyihkuh nan sah! Na chih lan khyh. Ka paaw nynh byathan alepaw thuasah, adihpaw thuasah kae kha thaesah leite cyih boi khyh; pawccemou ka paaw nynh hynh-e hynh yn phei cih? Papin yn phei lan khyh!” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama David nynh, “Kae nae sungsahnaw kha na paaw nynh nyh zah, ‘E hynh Jonathan nynh nyh nan sah, a ngaethah cih,’ cite a tua cih. Thuasalama thanccingte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, nang mah na hiin thyhte, kae te chinaw laku kya ccu kaw kheit rou nynh a um,” cite thyalawkute a ho. <verse number="4" style="v" />Jonathan nynh David kha, “Na hopaw miakaw kha kae cyipah cih,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />David nynh Jonathan kha, “Awkhualan tuh sawpaw thawpaw thua vae zah, siapharan ryte zerya mangkheihnaw kya ka haung khyh ze thuathya khyh; thuasalama nin thumnaw nin zete cia ramkaw kya zya reku khylan ka la cceih cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:11">Nam 28.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Na paaw nynh ka konglang yn la khia ze, ‘David tuh a khua Bethlehem lang ccia lan kae kha pekite yn ngiaku; pawccecize mih puizia hae balyn hanlan kum takyhte leih a rae hae paw silawnaw kha tuin khua kya a um,’ cite na la hopah cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Na paaw nynh, ‘Ahoy!’ a ci ze, na ryalahtu ka hanlan ahoy cih; thuasalama a thinria ze, hoyleinaw rae lan a paccynkuh cipaw la nyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze na ryalahtupaw hynh thaw yn ccitua, pawccecize athyaapaw byakinnaw kha na ryalahtupaw tuh phe na raekhae vae. Thuasalama ka tungvaw cyiseinaw a um ze, namaw ccaccei nynh yn theih; pawccemou na paaw kalan tuh nae cciakhae cih?” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Jonathan nynh, “Tuh-e tuh na tungvaw cyihkuh nan sah! Na tungvaw kya hoyleinaw ccawsah lanpaw kha ka paaw nynh a paccyn cipaw ka ny ze, nang kha hopya leite kae um cih zawtou?” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Te David nynh Jonathan kha, “Na paaw nynh byarepaw te ae khung ze, hum nynh mou kae kha yn hopah cih?” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Jonathan nynh David kha, “Rang, ramkaw lang cceih sih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze parouh mawte ramkaw lang a cceih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jonathan nynh David kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh aening ccaekia lang tang vae sah! Awkhualan khyhze sarukheih atu ccyh loukaw kya ka paaw kha ka la khiatua cih zah, David tungvaw kya tuanaw hoypaw a hoi ze, na kalan ccungccaw sawte tuh-e tuh hosahpya leite kae um cih zawtou? <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama ka paaw nynh nang kha vawsawnaw pya lan ae ry ze, khyndadyh lan na ccia nawlan, nang kha hopya leite kae um zah kae cciasah khyh ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Jonathan ka tungvaw kya tuhcite cyih sah lah, tuhlaeze mah cyih vae sah. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh ka paaw kya a la um hawte na kya um vae sah. <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hiin ung ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e zyn lan umpaw sungsahnaw kha ka tungvaw langsah tua; thuasalama ka chi ze, <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David a rhaw hae balyn kha laephi vawlan te a vua hae ze heize, zyn lan umpaw na sungsahnaw kha ka inn kyate papin vua nan,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:1">2Sa 9.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v" />Jonathan nynh David ciihan te byakinnaw rae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David a rhaw hae kha phulah vae hae sah,” a ci. <verse number="17" style="v" />Jonathan nynh amaw a hiinnaw kha a sungsah hawte David kha a sungsah keiccuze amaw kha mah a sungsahru nawlan David kha bya bua a kinsaku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jonathan nynh David kha, “Awkhualan tuh sawpaw thawpaw thua vae zah, na umnaw hmin accawnghan cih keiccuze na um khyhpaw a la langkuh cih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Sarukheih tuh na la cceihbung cih; langmaw na rekunaw hmin langkhe la cceih lah, tuin kya umpaw lung pe khe na la um cih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Themuing ka diapaw hawte lung pe langkhe the ccangthum kae kaw cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te imuapaw kha kae saw cih, ‘Cceih, the hae kha yn ccung hae,’ kae cipah cih. Imuapaw kha, ‘Dotua, the hae tuh nang te hynhlang sang nynh a um hae, yn khuin hae,’ ka cipya ze, nang tuh nae cceih cih, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, na hanlan khynnaw um zah ri lanpaw um khyh. <verse number="22" style="v" />Thuasalama ccangvaepaw kha, ‘Dotua, the hae tuh na khunglang nynh a um hae,’ ka cipya ze, na cceih vae cih; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha asawnaw lang ae cciasah vae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Nang te kae ah hokupaw konglang hynh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh nang te kae laku kya ccaekia lang zungzae a tang cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David tuh ramkaw kya a rekuh. Sawpaw thawpaw he yn thua tuh, siapharan tuh looh ae khylan a haung. <verse number="25" style="v" />Siapharan tuh ninhyn a haungnaw, pang pe e haungnaw kyakhe a haung. Jonathan tuh thadyn zah, Abner tuh Saul pe khe a haung; thuasalama David umnaw tuh accawnghan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuin nin kya Saul tuh pawpaw bya mah ho khyh; pawccecize, “A tungvaw hankhakheit acyihkuh vosi, aning tuh a thyaa khyhpaw nynh thua cih, a thyaa leinaw a um ccaccing cih,” cite a tua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Thuasalama nin ningnaw nin, sawpaw thawpaw awkhualan khe David umnaw tuh accawnghan. Te Saul nynh a ccapaw Jonathan kha, “Pawccemou Jesse ccapaw tuh inkhawnin thuasah, atunin thuasah looh-aenaw kalan yn thua khyh?” a cipya. <verse number="28" style="v" />Jonathan nynh Saul kha, “David nynh Bethlehem khua lang ccia lan pekite yn ngiakuh zah, <verse number="29" style="v" />‘Beih yn ccia sah; pawccecize ka puizia hae tuh tuin khua kya silawnaw poi rae hae zah, ka upaw nynh tuin kya umbua lan bya yn taw. Tukeiccuze na malang maehoynaw ka mue zetuh yn cciasah lah, ka upaw hae tuh beih yn muihsah hae,’ yn cipya. Tuh-e keiccuze siapharan aenaw ccaboi kalan yn thua khyh,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tetuh Saul nynh Jonathan tungvaw myarya a thinria zah, “A ccouseikuhnung te rhawthonung ccapaw! Namaw toulou maethyalawku nawlan te na nung kha a ccakaete maethyalaw khylan, Jesse ccapaw na pokupaw nyh lan khyh nae ci tou? <verse number="31" style="v" />Jesse ccapaw nynh laephi vawlan a hiin lungkhu balyn tuh nang thuasah, na peenaw thuasah tyn lan khyh. Atu ccungccaw saw lah, ka kalan yn thuakhae, aning tuh a chih ccaccing cih,” a cipya. <verse number="32" style="v" />Te Jonathan nynh a paaw Saul kha, “Pawccemou aning tuh chia athua cih? Pawmou a cyi?” cite a khung. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tetuh Saul nynh Jonathan kha a ccoi te tungsah khylan a khoih; tukeiccuze a paaw nynh David kha chia lan a tuaku ccaccing vae cipaw Jonathan nynh a ny. <verse number="34" style="v" />Jonathan tuh myarya thinriate ccaboi kyate thokuh zah, tuh-e sawpaw nin ningnaw nin tuh looh ae khyh, pawccecize a paaw nynh David kha a thethyasah keiccuze David elang myarya a ngaethah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Awkhualan awkhua khe Jonathan tuh imuapaw kha hoeikuh zah David te tungku lan a hokunaw hae ramkaw langkhe a cceih. <verse number="36" style="v" />Aning nynh imuapaw kha, “Ccue lah, ka kawpaw the kha yn ccung hae,” a cipya. Imuapaw a ccue lyakhe, the ccangkheit kha tuh-e paw po a khunglang a kaw. <verse number="37" style="v" />Imuapaw tuh Jonathan the a ccawnaw kya he a thua te, Jonathan nynh imuapaw kha ko zah, “The ccangkheit tuh na khunglang khe um khyh tou?” a cipya. <verse number="38" style="v" />Jonathan nynh imuapaw kha ko zah, “Rangsakuh, arangte cceih, um nan,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Jonathan a imuapaw nynh the hae kha khuin zah a bawipaw kalan a cceih. <verse number="39" style="v" />Thuasalama imuapaw nynh pawpaw mah nyh khyh; Jonathan te David rou nynh tuh-e paccynnaw tuh a nyh hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Jonathan nynh a zunghe hae kha imuapaw kalan pya zah, “La cceih lah, e hae hynh khualae lang la phu,” a cipya. <verse number="41" style="v" />Imuapaw he a cceih takaw te, David tuh lungpum pe te yn thokuh zah laekhu kya a bakhung. Vae thum a bakhung koute, minmin tuh myngkuh hae zah a rawkhaekuh hae; David tuh a rahhua. <verse number="42" style="v" />Te Jonathan nynh David kha, “Ngaengante la cceih, pawccecize, ‘Kae te nang laku kya, ka ciihan hae te na ciihan hae laku kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh zungzae um sah,’ cite parouh mawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min phyate bya ah kinku vae,” a cipya. Te David tuh thokuh zah a cceih; Jonathan tuh khualae lang a tee.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David te Athyaapaw Sanlou</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David tuh Nob khua e ranpibawi Ahimelek kalan a thua. Ahimelek tuh David te tungku lan thyngkute cceih zah, “Pawccemou lu kheit san umbua leite, na makhaete nae thua?” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.1-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:3-4">Mat 12.3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:25-26">Mar 2.25-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:3">Luk 6.3</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh ranpibawi Ahimelek kha, “Siapharan nynh ryalaw ccangkheit yn naw zah, ‘Kae nawpaw rya konglang hynh humhung nynh mah nyh nan sah,’ yn cipya. Tuin kya, khe kya tungku lan cite ccangvae hae kha ka hopya vae hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu na kuih kya pawmou na hoi? Sanlou phe pangaw yn pyatua, tuhkhyhze hein kya a umpaw pawpaw zemah,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ranpibawi nynh David kha, “Sanlou huataw tuh ka kuih kya ka hoi khyh, ccangvae hae nynh nopi hae kya a la sungku hae zetuh, athyaapaw sanlou tuh a um,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />David nynh ranpibawi kha, “Rya ccangkhakheit hanlan ka ccia lya hawte nopi hae kha kae sungku ccaccing; khuaccong huatawnaw kya heize ccangvae hae uccaw tuh athyaa; mih uccaw tuh atunin thathy tuh hohcihmou houh athyaa vae cih?” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ranpibawi nynh athyaapaw sanlou kha a pya; pawccecize tuin kyakhe Nungpyapaw sanlou laelan ccangpaw sanlou um khyh, tuh-e sanlou tuh sanlou thawpaw te rulae khylan law athua nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang kyate nue athua vae paw nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-9">Lev 24.5-9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuin nin khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khee athuapaw, Saul a ryalahtu hae kya-e lu kheitpaw tuh tuin kya a um; a min tuh Doeg acikuh, Edom minphuinpaw thua zah Saul a tuurin hae kya-e lupi nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David nynh Ahimelek kha, “Na kya ccoi khyhze thaloi um khyh tou? Siapharan rya kha arangte law aho keiccuze ka thaloi thuasah, ka zunghe hae thuasah ka ccyngkuh khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ranpibawi nynh, “Elah accya kya na chiapaw Filistin paw Goliath thaloi tuh boei te lungdekuh zah ranpibawi angki nulang khe a um; na law ry ze lawkuh, khah-e laelan ccangpaw um khyh,” a cipya. David nynh, “Khah-e thaloi te alokuhpaw um khyh, yn pyatua,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:51">1Sa 17.51</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">David Gath lang A Ccue</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />David tuh thokuh zah tuin nin khe Saul kyate ccue zah, Gath siapharan Akhish kalan a cceih. <verse number="11" style="v" />Akhish a ryalahtu hae nynh amaw kha, “E paw hynh mih ram kya-e siapharan David kha thua khyh tou? Minmin nynh lawbia hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Saul nynh athong thong te,</para>
  <para style="q2">David nynh athong-asan te</para>
  <para style="q1">a chia hae,’ cite liakute</para>
  <para style="q2">hlawsah khyh hae tou?” a ci hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:7">1Sa 18.7</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 29:5">29.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />David nynh hynh-e bya hynh pekite tua zah Gath siapharan Akhish kha myarya a rih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 56">Sam 56</ref> (Abyalu)</char></note> <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze mih malang khe a umtu ziazae kha rulae zah, a muihnaw hae kyakhe a ngaeepaw hawte a umsaku. Aning nynh thuakaw hae kha varivarae hya zah, a tuing kha a khawming kyate a luisah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34">Sam 34</ref> (Abyalu)</char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Akhish nynh a ryalahtu hae kha, “Dotua oh, e paw tuh a ngaeepaw nynh thua; pawccemou ka kalan nae thuakhae oh? <verse number="15" style="v" />A ngaeepaw ka hoi khyh keiccu tou hynh-e paw hynh ka malang a ngaeenaw langsaku lan nae thuakhae oh? E paw hynh ka inn lungkhu lang a tee cih tou?” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David te A Zuitu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David tuh tuin kyate cceih zah Adullam lungkarung langkhe a ccue; tuh-e tuh a uno hae te a paaw puizia hae balyn nynh a thae hae te, a kalan a cceih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 57">Sam 57</ref> (Abyalu); <ref loc="PSA 142">Sam 142</ref> (Abyalu)</char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />A riathaepaw miakaw, laebah a hoipaw miakaw te a lungryachih leipaw miakaw tuh amaw kalan a sueluakuh hae; aning tuh minmin kya uktu lang a tang. A kya um hae paw tuh za pali loukaw acih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David tuh tuin kyate Moab ram Mizpeh khua lang cceih zah, Moab siapharan kha, “Pachia nynh ka hanlan a cyi lanpaw kha ka ny mawlaezung, ka nung te ka paaw tuh na kalan cciate beih umbua hae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Minmin kha Moab siapharan kya cciatawsya hae zah, David tuh akhynnaw hmin kya a um lungkhu balyn, tuh-e paw kya a umbua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te profeh Gad nynh David kha, “E lungkarung kya um nan vae, pou lah, Judah ram lang la cceih,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze David tuh pou zah Hereth ramkaw langkhe a cceih.</para>
  <para style="s1">Saul nynh Ranpibawi hae Chianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David te a kya um hae paw kha a muih hae cite Saul nynh a thae. Saul tuh Gibeah khua e ahangnaw hmin kya umpaw tamarisk thingku kaw khe a ccoi ccyngkuh zah a haung, a ryalahtu hae balyn tuh amaw kha voilu hae zah a thadyn hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaw kha voilute a thadyn hae paw a ryalahtu hae kyakhe Saul nynh, “Nanning Benjamin phin hae, thaetua oh, Jesse ccapaw nynh nanning balyn kha loo te misu khokhu ae pya cih oh tou? Milu thong kheit uktu te za kheit uktu rhawbawi lang pong ae nung cih oh tou? <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuhte athua keiccu tou nae balynte aruh lante nae phee oh? Ka ccapaw nynh Jesse ccapaw te nawccawkheihnaw a rae hae paw kha lu kheit nynh san nae hopah khyh oh, ka hanlan a ngaethahpaw na um khyh oh, ka ryalahtupaw nynh atunin a cyi vae hawte, kae kha rawse khylan te buh khylan ka ccapaw nynh ka ryalahtupaw a tuhoupaw kha humhung nynh mah nae hopah khyh oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul a ryalahtu hae kyaze lupi athuapaw Edom minphuinpaw Doeg nynh, “Ahitub ccapaw Ahimelek kalan, Nob khua lang a cceihpaw Jesse ccapaw kha ka muih;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.9-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:7-9">1Sa 21.7-9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 52">Sam 52</ref> (Abyalu)</char></note> <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahimelek nynh aning hanlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha byakhiapah zah, looh te Filistin paw Goliath thaloi kha a pya,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Ahitub ccapaw Ahimelek te a puizia hae balyn, Nob khua um hae paw ranpibawi hae kha kosah hae zah, mih balynte siapharan kalan a cceih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Saul nynh, “Ahitub ccapaw, ngaetua,” cipah zah, aning nynh, “Ka bawipaw, hein kya mang ka um,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Saul nynh amaw kha, “Nang te Jesse ccapaw nynh pawccemou aruh lante nae phee oh? Aning nynh atunin a cyi vae hawte, kae kha dou khylan te buh khylan, sanlou te thaloi kha na pya zah aning hanlan Pachia kalan bya na khiapya,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Te Ahimelek nynh siapharan kha, “Na ryalahtu hae balyn kyaze David hawte hummou a lungzi? Aning tuh siapharan paeepaw thua zah, na pyn rhawviatu hae lupi te na inn kya sawtuanaw a ccoupaw nynh thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Atunin hynh aning hanlan Pachia kalan masaty bya ka khiapyapaw athua zawtou? Thua khyh! Siapharan nynh na ryalahtupaw tungvaw kya thuasah, ka puizia hae tungvaw kya thuasah pawpaw mah oun seisah nan, pawccecize na ryalahtupaw nynh e konglang balyn hynh patae thuasah, beihtaraw thuasah pawpaw mah ka nyh khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Ahimelek, nang te na puizia hae balyn tuh na chih ccaccing cih oh,” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Siapharan nynh a pe thadyn hae paw rhawviatu hae kyakhe, “Maeleihkuh oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ranpibawi hae kha theih oh, pawccecize minmin nynh David kha pankhae hae zah, a ccuepaw kha mang a nyh hae pite yn hopah khyh hae,” a cipya hae. Thuasalama siapharan a ryalahtu hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ranpibawi hae kha chia lan mih kuih hangnua khyh hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan nynh Doeg kha, “Doeg, nang nynh maeleihkuh lah, ranpibawi hae hynh theih hae,” a cipya. Edom minphuinpaw Doeg nynh maeleihkuh zah ranpibawi hae kha a chia hae; tuin nin khe laphan laaw te kuakuhpaw ranpibawi angki kikuhpaw sung tarya lu pangaw kha a chia hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae khua Nob khua um hae paw kha thaloi te a bae hae; nopi te pise, imua te nosi, tangnuapaw, lann te tuu hae kha thaloi te a bae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama Ahitub ccapaw Ahimelek a ccapaw hae kya-e lu kheit, a min Abiathar cikuhpaw tuh lue zah David kalan a ccue. <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ranpibawi hae a chia vae hae cipaw kha Abithar nynh David kha a hopya. <verse number="22" style="v" />David nynh Abithar kha, “Khah lyaze Edom minphuinpaw Doeg a umbua keiccuze Saul kha a hopah mamin vae cih cipaw khah-e nin kya maw phe ka ny vae. Na paaw puizia hae balyn nynh a chi hae paw tuh kae ka keiccu nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka kya um lah, rih nan; pawccecize ka hiinnaw a ccungpaw tuh na hiinnaw ae ccungpaw nynh thua; ka kya um lah, na khyn cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David nynh Keilah Khua A Khum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Filistin hae nynh Keilah khua kha tuk hae zah, huimin hae kha a luade hae,” cite David kya a hopya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha khia zah, “E Filistin hae hynh ccianuate ka tuk cih hae tou?” a cipya. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha, “Cceih lah, Filistin hae kha tuk hae lah, Keilah khua kha khumtua,” a cipya. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama David kha a ccungccaw hae nynh, “Dotua, Judah ram kya heize ah rih oh; Keilah khua lang cciate Filistin rhawkaw hae kha tuk lanpaw tuh hohcihmou ri lan houh um vae?” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Te David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha bua khia zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Thokuh lah, Keilah khua lang cceihbung; pawccecize Filistin hae kha na kuih kalan kae pya cih,” a cipya. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David te a ccungccaw hae tuh Keilah khua lang cceih hae zah Filistin hae kha a tuk hae, mih sahiin hae kha lawpah hae zah minmin kha patae a chia hae. Tuhcite David nynh Keilah khuaccaaw hae kha a luesah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahimelek ccapaw Abiathar nynh Keilah khua umpaw David kalan he a ccue tuh, ranpibawi angki zung kheit kha a ccyngbia. <verse number="7" style="v" />Keilah khua kya David a thua cipaw kha Saul kya a hopya hae. Te Saul nynh, “Pachia nynh amaw kha ka kuih kya yn pya vae; pawccecize koikua te khawnawpaw thingccaw hae a hoipaw khua lungkhu lang teete amaw te amaw a khawsungkuh vae,” a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" />Saul nynh ccungccaw balyn kha Keilah khua lang cciabungte David te a ccungccaw hae kha koihlu khylan te tuk khylan a ko hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul nynh a tungvaw hoyleinaw rae lan a paccyn vae cipaw kha David nynh he a nyh tuh, ranpibawi Abiathar kyakhe, “Ranpibawi angki kha hynhlang yn cciakhae,” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />David nynh, “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia, na ryalahtupaw kae ka keiccuze Saul nynh Keilah khua lang cciate khua kha ro lan a paccyn cite ka thae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Keilah khuaccaaw hae nynh kae hynh amaw kuih kalan yn ap cih hae tou? Na ryalahtupaw nynh ka thae hawte Saul tuh yn cceih cih tou? Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia, na ryalahtupaw hynh nae hopya nawlan kae ngiaku,” a cipya. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Saul tuh yn cceih cih,” a cipya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te David nynh, “Keilah khuaccaaw hae nynh kae te ka ccungccaw hae hynh Saul kuih kalan oun ap cih hae tou?” cite khia zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh, “Nang kha ae ap cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh David te za taruh loukaw acih hae paw a ccungccaw hae tuh thokuh hae zah Keilah khua kyate a pou hae; a ccia khonaw hae miakaw langkhe a cceih hae. David tuh Keilah khua kyate a ccue vae cipaw kha Saul kya he a hopah hae tuh, ccia lanpaw kha a umtaw vae. <verse number="14" style="v" />David tuh Zif Ramkaw e muaram kya, ramkaw e akhynnaw hmin kya a um. Saul nynh nin takyh a ccung zemah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha a kuih kya pya khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">David nynh Saul A Sibia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />David tuh Zif Ramkaw, Horesh kya a um lyakhe, Saul nynh a hiinnaw chia khylan a ccung cipaw kha a ny. <verse number="16" style="v" />Saul ccapaw Jonathan tuh thokuh zah Horesh kya umpaw David kalan a cceih; tuin kyakhe aning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> liate khynnaw a mue nawlan thawzung a pya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Aning nynh David kha, “Rih nan; pawccecize ka paaw Saul a kuih nynh nang kha ae muih lan khyh; nang tuh Israel siapharan lang na tang cih zah, kae tuh nang ae zuipaw lu ningnaw ka thua cih; tuhte acyiku lanpaw tuh ka paaw Saul nynh mah a ny,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te mih lu ning mawte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe byakinnaw kha a rae hae; David tuh Horesh kya um zah Jonathan tuh inn lang a ki.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:3">1Sa 18.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Zif khuaccaaw hae abang tuh Gibeah khua umpaw Saul kalan cceihthung hae zah, “David tuh kae ram lungkhu, Jeshimon khua alia lang umpaw Hakhilah mua vawlan, Horesh e akhynnaw hmin kya nynh a reku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 54">Sam 54</ref> (Abyalu)</char></note> <verse number="20" style="v" />Pou siapharan, na ccia ry ccyh kya yn cceihbung vae ii, aning kha siapharan kuih kalan pya lanpaw tuh kaening ryalaw nynh thua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Saul nynh, “Ka tungvaw ngaethya nae umsah oh keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hythua ae pya vae oh sah! <verse number="22" style="v" />Cceih oh lah, phe ria lan oun cyitua oh; a umnaw hmin te tuin kya hum nynh mou a muih cipaw kha phe ria lan oun dotua oh; pawccecize aning tuh myarya a thyaruh cite yn hopya hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />A rekunaw hmin balyn kha akaw-aleih la do oh lah, phe ariapaw bya khate ka kalan nae ki cih oh. Te kamaw ryte ccia lan oh; ram lungkhu a um zetuh, Judah ccungccaw athong-asan hae laku kya aning kha ka ccung cih,” a ci. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin tuh thokuh hae zah Saul a ccia mawkhe Zif lang a cceih hae. David te a ccungccaw hae tuh Jeshimon alia lang, Arabah ram lungkhu, Maon ramkaw khe a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Saul te a ccungccaw hae tuh David ccung lan a cceih hae. David kha he a hopah hae tuh, aning tuh Maon ramkaw kya umpaw lungpi kalan cceihbung zah tuin kya a um. Tuh-e tuh Saul nynh a thae tuh, Maon ramkaw langkhe David kha a deehui. <verse number="26" style="v" />Saul tuh mua voikheit langte cceih zah, David te a ccungccaw hae tuh mua voikheit langte a cceih hae. Saul te a ccungccaw hae nynh David te a ccungccaw hae kha kyng khylan a naeku lya hae khe, David tuh Saul kyate lue khylan a rangsakuh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Te locceihtu lu kheit tuh Saul kalan yn thua zah, “Arangte yn cceih; pawccecize Filistin hae nynh ram kha a tuk vae hae,” a cipya. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Saul nynh David kha deehui leite umtaw zah, Filistin hae kha tuk khylan a ccianua hae; tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh Luenaw Lungpi a ci hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />David tuh tuin kyate cceih zah, En-gedi pee kya umpaw akhynnaw hmin kya a um.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David nynh Saul kha Theih Khyh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saul tuh Filistin hae a deehuinaw hae kyate he yn ki tuh, “David tuh En-gedi ramkaw kya a um,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tetuh Saul nynh Israel hae balyn kya-e popaw ccungccaw thong thum kha ko hae zah, David te a ccungccaw hae kha ccung khylan Sathaw Lungpi langkhe a cceih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Laanpi pe umpaw tuukhia kya thua zah, tuin kyakhe lungkarung ccangkheit a um; Saul tuh toiku lan a tee. David te a ccungccaw hae tuh lungkarung alungkhu lang adianaw kyakhe a haung hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 57">Sam 57</ref> (Abyalu); <ref loc="PSA 142">Sam 142</ref> (Abyalu)</char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />David a ccungccaw hae nynh, “ ‘Na rhawpaw kha na kuih kya kae pya cih zah, ahoy na ci hawte a tungvaw na cyih cih,’ cite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ae hopyapaw nin tuh hynh-e nin hynh nynh athua vae,” a cipya hae. Te David nynh cceih zah Saul angkiccua apaki kha zya a aw. <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul angkiccua apaki kha a awpya keiccuze David tuh nyalangte ngaesikuh zah, <verse number="6" style="v" />a ccungccaw hae kyakhe, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh chitui thuhpaw ka bawipaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e chitui thuhpaw athua keiccuze a tungvaw ka kuih hangnua lanpaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn khee vae sah,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:11">1Sa 26.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuhcite David nynh a ccungccaw hae kha pe biate hopah hae zah Saul tuk lanpaw kha kaw-ua khyh hae. Te Saul tuh thokuh zah lungkarung kyate pou zah a cceih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukoute David mah thokuh zah lungkarung kyate pou zah Saul a nulang te, “Ka bawipaw siapharan!” cite a ko. Saul nynh a nulang he a do tuh, David nynh laekhu kya bakhung zah sawtuanaw a pya. <verse number="9" style="v" />David nynh Saul kha, “ ‘David nynh nang kha vawsawnaw pya lan a zuaku,’ cite a ho hae paw bya kha pawccemou na ngae? <verse number="10" style="v" />Atunin mawkhe lungkarung kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha ka kuih kya yn pya cipaw kha na mit nynh a muih vae; abang nynh nang chia lanpaw kha yn tuhou hae zemah, nang kha kae haang. ‘Ka bawipaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh chitui thuhpaw athua keiccuze ka kuih ka hangnua lan khyh,’ ka ci. <verse number="11" style="v" />Apang, dotua, ka kuih kya umpaw na angkiccua apaki hynh dotua; na angkiccua apaki tuh ka aw zah namaw kha kae chia khyh keiccuze, ka kuih kya hoyleinaw thuasah, cyiseinaw thuasah um khyh cipaw kha ccaerarih lan na nyh cih zah na muih cih. Ka hiinnaw chia lan nae ccung salamah na tungvaw ka sei khyh. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang te kae laku kya <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh bya oun pia vae sah! <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh na tungvaw kya phu yn lawpah vae sah; thuasalama ka kuih nynh nang kha ae rawse lan khyh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Langmawlya e phungtangbya kyaze, ‘Ccungccaw hoyleipaw kyate hoyleinaw a pou,’ cite a um; thuasalama ka kuih nynh nang kha ae rawse lan khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel siapharan nynh hum kha mou rawse zah a pounua? Hummou na deehui? Ui chihpaw tou? Uili tou?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 26:20">1Sa 26.20</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh byapiatu thua sah lah, nang te kae laku kya byapae vae sah. Oun dopah sah lah, ka byathan hynh pankhaete na kyate yn luesah vae sah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuhcite David nynh Saul kha bya a hopah koute, Saul nynh, “Ka ccapaw David, tuh-e roi tuh namaw roi athua tou?” a cipya. Saul nynh a roisaw zah a rah. <verse number="17" style="v" />Aning nynh David kha, “Nang tuh kae laeze na dinghua; pawccecize kae nynh athahpaw te kae liaru zemah nang nynh tuh ahoypaw te nae liaru. <verse number="18" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae hynh na kuih lungkhu yn nung ccyh lyaze kae hynh nae chia khyh keiccuze, ka tungvaw ahoy lante nae ccuepenawpaw kha atunin nae langsahpya vae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ccungccaw nynh a rhaw kha a muih ze khyndadyh lante a cciasah cih zawtou? Tukeiccuze atunin ka tungvaw na cyipaw hanlan hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hoynaw khate ae sangru vae sah. <verse number="20" style="v" />Atu tuh nang tuh siapharan lang na tang ccaccing cih zah, Israel peenaw tuh na kuih kya atyn cih cipaw ka ny. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang nynh ka ciihan hae kha na chia khyh nawlan hae te ka paaw puizia hae kyate ka min hynh na la the khyh nawlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te bya yn kinpakuh,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David nynh tuh-e tuh Saul kyakhe bya a kinpyaku. Te Saul tuh a inn lang a ki, thuasalama David te a ccungccaw hae tuh akhynnaw hmin langkhe a cceih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Samuel Chinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Samuel he chih tuh, Israel hae balyn tuh sueluakuh hae zah a rah hae, te Ramah khua e a inn kyakhe a uu hae.</para>
  <para style="p">Te David tuh thokuh zah Paran ramkaw langkhe a cceih.</para>
  <para style="s1">David te Nabal Zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Maon kyakhe ccungccapaw lu kheit um zah a hoirumnaw tuh Karmel khua kya nynh a um. Tuh-e paw tuh myarya a hoirum; tuu thong thum te miaa thong kheit a hoi. Karmel khua khe a tuu hae ming kha a ngo hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuh-e paw min tuh Nabal cikuh zah, a zu min tuh Abigail acikuh. Tuh-e nopinung tuh a hawpaw te a puithyapaw nynh thua, thuasalama pisepaw tuh a rysawthahpaw te a ozia thahpaw nynh thua; aning tuh Kaleb phin nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Nabal tuh a tuuming a ngo cciamang cipaw kha David nynh ramkaw khe a thae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David nynh ccangvae lu haw kha a saw hae; David nynh ccangvae hae kyakhe, “Karmel khua lang, Nabal kalan la cceih oh lah, ka min te bya la beih oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Hynhcite sawtuate na la hopah cih oh: ‘Na tungvaw daenaw um sah, na innbyn tungvaw daenaw um sah lah, na hoipaw balyn tungvaw kya daenaw um vae sah. <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang tuh tuuming ngotu hae na hoi cite ka thae; atu na tuurin hae tuh kae kya um hae zah, vawsawnaw kae pya khyh hae, Karmel khua kya a um lungkhu hae balyn, mih uccaw pawpaw mah zo khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Na ccangvae hae kha khia hae lah, ae hopah cih hae. Tukeiccuze ka ccangvae hae tuh na malang maehoynaw mue vae hae sah; kaening tuh poi tua nin kya nynh kae thua. Na kuih kya a umpaw miakaw kha na ryalahtu hae te na ccapaw David kalan beih oun pya,’ na la cipah cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />David ccangvae hae he a thua hae te, tuh-e balyn tuh David min te Nabal kha a hopya hae; te minmin nynh a ngaw hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama Nabal nynh David a ryalahtu hae kyakhe, “David tuh hummou athua? Jesse ccapaw tuh hummou athua? Atu she lya tuh mih bawi hae kyate a ccue hae paw ryalahtu patae a um hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka tuuming ngotu hae elang ka chiapaw saw te ka sanlou te ka tui kha lawpyate, tei kyate oun thua hae paw cipaw ka ny leipaw ccungccaw hae kha ka pya cih hae tou?” a cipya hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David a ccangvae hae tuh maeleihkute ki hae zah, tuh-e balyn tuh David kha a hopya hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />David nynh a ccungccaw hae kha, “Ccungccaw miakaw nynh a thaloi kha a cce kya kekuh sah!” a cipya hae. Te mih balynte mih thaloi kha ccarou a keku hae; David mah a thaloi a kekuh bua; te milu za pali tuh David nulang zuikuh hae zah, milu za ning tuh mih uccaw kha a ngaw hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ccangvaepaw lu kheit nynh Nabal zu Abigail kalan cceih zah, “David nynh ah bawipaw kha byabeih khylan locceihtu hae kha ramkaw kyate oun saw hae zah, aning nynh minmin kha saryate a sianua hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuhzemah minmin tuh kae tungvaw myarya hoy hae zah, vawsawnaw kae teing khyh, ramkaw kya kae um zah minmin ryte kae umkheih lungkhu balyn, pawpaw uccaw mah papin zo khyh; <verse number="16" style="v" />tuu kae rin zah minmin ryte kae umkheih lungkhu balyn, khuazi khuadae oun thungkhaw hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu hynh-e hynh nyh lah, na cyi lanpaw kha tuaku tua; pawccecize kae bawipaw te a innbyn balyn tungvaw kya hoyleinaw rae lanpaw kha byapae athua vae; aning tuh humhung nynh mah bya hopya kho lei lan ciate ccungccathya athua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tetuh Abigail nynh rangsakuh zah sanlou za ning, misutui kha savingtui-ung ccangning, avoi ty vae paw tuu sa pangaw saw, thoupaw ccathae kha ccathae tounawpaw te kaw pangaw, misu thae aroupaw nge za kheit te thaeku thae aphe za ning kha lah zah, lann hae tungvaw a khang, <verse number="19" style="v" />te a ccangvae hae kha, “Ka malang la cceih oh; kae tuh nae nulang te kae cceih cih,” a cipya hae. Thuasalama a vawpaw Nabal kha hopah khyh. <verse number="20" style="v" />Lann kha ccikuh zah mua aleihpaw kya a rungbung lyakhe, David te a ccungccaw hae tuh a kalan oun rungbung hae zah a tungkuh hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />A tungku maw hae khe, David nynh, “Aning nynh a hoipaw balyn kha ccangkheit san azo khyh nawlan, hynh-e paw nynh ramkaw kya a hoipaw balyn kha alakaw lan nynh ka la rinpya ccaccing; aning nynh ahoypaw kha athahpaw te yn liaru. <verse number="22" style="v" />Awkhualan khua he dae te, Nabal te asekuh hae paw balyn kya-e pise lu kheit kha chia leite ka cciataw ze, tuhmaminte thuasah, tuhlaeze mah thuasah Pachia nynh David tungvaw cyih vae sah,” cite a la ho vae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abigail nynh David kha a muih tuh, lann tungvaw te arangte rung zah, David malang khe laekhu kya a bakhung. <verse number="24" style="v" />A cculeihpaw khe bakhung zah, “Ka bawipaw, seinaw tuh ka makhae tungvaw kya um vae sah; na ryalahtunung nynh na nakaring kya beih kae hopah sah lah, na ryalahtunung bya hynh beih yn ngaepya tua. <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka bawipaw, hynh-e ccungccaw hoyleipaw Nabal bya hynh beih ccuinpah nan; pawccecize aning tuh a min a um hawte nynh athua; a min tuh Nabal cikuh zah amaw kya ngaeenaw a um; thuasalama na ryalahtunung kae tuh ka bawipaw nang nynh nae saw hae paw na ccangvae hae kha ka muih khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Te atu tuh ka bawipaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, nang mah na hiin thyhte, ccungccaw chiapaw seinaw kyate thuasah, namaw kuih ccaccei te phulawnaw raenaw kyate thuasah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha ae khee keiccuze, na rhaw hae te ka bawipaw tungvaw kya hoyleinaw rae lan a zuakuh hae paw tuh Nabal hawte thua vae hae sah. <verse number="27" style="v" />Atu na ryalahtunung nynh ka bawipaw kalan kae ccyngpyapaw hynh-e lasung hynh ka bawipaw ae zui hae paw ccangvae hae kalan pya thua sah. <verse number="28" style="v" />Na ryalahtunung ka seinaw hynh beih yn ngaethya; pawccecize ka bawipaw nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a rhawpaw kha na tuk keiccuze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka bawipaw nang tuh atynpaw inn kha ae sakpah cih; na hiin lungkhu balyn na tungvaw kya hoyleinaw kha muih thua lan khyh. <verse number="29" style="v" />Lukhakheit nynh nang kha deehui lan te chia khylan ae thonuaku ze, ka bawipaw hiinnaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia do-oihnaw lungkhu a umpaw hiinnaw sungkua lungkhu khe tungbia athua cih; thuasalama na rhaw hae kha tuh henuanawpaw zae kyate a toikuhpaw hawte a toisakuh cih hae. <verse number="30" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh namaw konglang a ho vae paw hoynaw balyn kha na tungvaw kya rae zah, Israel uktu bawi lang he ae nung te, <verse number="31" style="v" />akonglang um leite chiise luasahnaw kong thuasah, namaw ccaccei nynh phulawnaw kong thuasah, ka bawipaw nang tuh ngaethyanaw te namaw toulou seisakunaw um lan khyh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka bawipaw tungvaw kya hoynaw he a rae te, na ryalahtunung hynh yn ning nan vae ii,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David nynh Abigail kha, “Atunin kae te tungku khylan ae sawtupaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh thehoyte um sah! <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahoypaw na tuanaw kya hythuanaw um vae sah, chiise luasahnaw kyate thuasah, kamaw kuih ccaccei te phulawnaw kyate thuasah atunin yn kheetu namaw kya mah hythuanaw um vae sah! <verse number="34" style="v" />Thanccingte nang kha vawsawnaw pyanaw kyate yn kheetu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh a hiin thyhte, kae te tungku khylan arangte nae ccia khyh ze, awkhualan awkhua tuh Nabal ccungccaw pise lu kheit san hiin vae lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="35" style="v" />Abigail nynh a ccyngpyapaw lasung kha a kuih kyate David nynh lawpakuh zah, “Na inn lang lungdaete la cceih; dotua, na bya kha kae ngaepah zah, nae ngiapaw kha kae pya vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Abigail tuh Nabal kya a thua; aning nynh siapharan poi tahawpaw poi kha a inn kya a la tua. Nabal tuh myarya a rui keiccuze lungpawte a um; tukeiccuze khua adae mawlaezung pawpaw mah hopah khyh. <verse number="37" style="v" />Awkhualan awkhua, Nabal tuh misutui a ruipaw he a ccite, tuh-e konglang kha a zu nynh hopah zah, a thinlung tuh chih zah aning tuh lung hawte nynh athua vae. <verse number="38" style="v" />Nin haw loukaw aro koute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Nabal kha detah zah a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nabal a chih vae cipaw kha David nynh he a thae te, “Nabal nynh yn saryanawpaw byathan kha bya yn piapah zah, a ryalahtu kha hoyleinaw kyate yn thungkhawtu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh thehoyte um sah; Nabal nynh a raepaw hoyleinaw kha amaw vawlan khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccawsah vae,” a ci. Te David nynh ccungccaw saw hae zah Abigail kha a zu lang a soihbiasah hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />David a ryalahtu hae tuh Karmel kya umpaw Abigail kya he a thua hae te, “David nynh a zu lang ko lan kaening hynh na kalan oun saw,” a cipya hae. <verse number="41" style="v" />Abigail nynh thokuh zah laekhu kya bakhung zah, “Kae tuh ka bawipaw a ryalahtu hae ccu kha a singpaw seenung nynh ka thua,” a cipya hae. <verse number="42" style="v" />Abigail tuh arangte thokuh zah lann tungvaw a ccikuh; a ryalahtu nopi hae lu pangaw nynh amaw kha a do-oih hae. Abigail tuh David a locceihtu hae kya zuikuh bua zah David zu lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />David nynh Jezreel khuanung Ahinoam kha mah zu lang a umkhae; parouh mawte a zu lang a tang hae. <verse number="44" style="v" />Saul nynh David zu athuapaw a ccanung Mikhal kha Gallim khuapaw Laish ccapaw Palti kalan zu lang phe a la pya vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:14-16">2Sa 3.14-16</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David nynh Saul kha Bua A Haang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zif khuaccaaw hae tuh Gibeah khua umpaw Saul kalan oun thua hae zah, “David tuh Jeshimon te a hawiliakuh hae paw Hakhilah mua kya a rekuh,” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 54">Sam 54</ref> (Abyalu)</char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Saul tuh thokuh zah Israel ccungccaw popaw milu thong thum kha hoeikute Zif Ramkaw kya David kha ccung khylan Zif Ramkaw lang a cceihbung. <verse number="3" style="v" />Saul tuh Jeshimon te a hawiliakuh hae paw Hakhilah mua vawlan, laanpi pe khe a rya. David tuh ramkaw kya a um; Saul nynh ramkaw lang yn deehui vae cipaw he a nyh te, <verse number="4" style="v" />David nynh dophitu hae kha saw hae zah, Saul tuh yn thua ccaccing cipaw a ny. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh David tuh cceih zah Saul a ryanaw hmin kya a thua; David nynh Saul te a rhawbawipaw Abner, Ner ccapaw nynh a inaw hae hmin kha a muih. Saul tuh ryahmin lungkhu khe ih zah, a rhawkaw hae tuh a pepan po voilu lan a ih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />David nynh Hit ccungccaw Ahimelek te Zeruiah ccapaw Abishai, Joab neitaw kyakhe, “Ryahmin lungkhu lang, Saul kalan hummou yn zui cih?” cite khia hae zah, Abishai nynh, “Kamaw kae zui cih,” a cipya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David te Abishai tuh khuazi khe rhawkaw hae kalan a cceih hae; tuin kyakhe Saul tuh ryahmin lungkhu la ih zah, a ccoi tuh a lu pe laekhu kya a la bing; Abner te rhawkaw hae tuh a pepan po voilu lan a ih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Abishai nynh David kha, “Pachia nynh na rhawpaw kha na kuih kalan atunin ae pya vae; tukeiccuze aning hynh laephi kya phang bingkuh lan, ccoi te vae kheit kyalya kae thuing; vae ning ka thuing lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuasalama David nynh Abishai kha, “Aning kha roh nan; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh chitui thuhpaw ccungccaw kha a kuih a hangnua paw tuh sei leite a um cih zawtou?” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />David nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh amaw kha a theih cih; tuhkhyhze a chi nin tuh yn thua mamin cih; tuhkhyhze rhawtuknaw lang a cceih cih zah a chih cih. <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh chitui thuhpaw tungvaw kya ka kuih hangnua lanpaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh yn khee vae sah; thuasalama a lu pe umpaw ccoi te tui-ung kha lah lah, cceih ccavae sih,” a cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 24:6">1Sa 24.6</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David nynh Saul a lu pe umpaw ccoi te tui-ung kha lah zah, a cceih hae. Tuh-e tuh humhung nynh mah muih khyh zah nyh khyh, humhung mah a inaw kyate thaekuh khyh; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh thuhbabi lan a isah hae keiccuze mih balynte marya a ih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh David tuh accya khuraw langkhe cceih zah, asawnaw e mua dung khe thadyn zah, minmin laku tuh myarya asawkuh. <verse number="14" style="v" />David nynh rhawkaw hae te Ner ccapaw Abner kha ko hae zah, “Abner! Bya nae khungru lan khyh tou?” a cipya. Te Abner nynh, “Siapharan a kopaw tuh hummou na thua?” cite a khung. <verse number="15" style="v" />David nynh Abner kha, “Pise na thua khyh tou? Israel hae kya nang ae lopaw hummou a um? Tuhte athua lanze, na bawipaw siapharan kha pawccemou na ngaw khyh? Pawccecize ccungccaw lu kheit nynh na bawipaw siapharan kha chia khylan a teenua. <verse number="16" style="v" />Rya na lawpaw hoy khyh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh chitui thuhpaw, na bawipaw kha na ngaw khyh keiccuze nang tuh chi lan na ccan. Atu dotua, siapharan lu pe umpaw a ccoi te tui-ung kha teimou a um vae hae?” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Saul nynh David roi kha syntaw zah, “Ka ccapaw David, tuh-e tuh namaw roi athua tou?” a cipya. David nynh, “Pou siapharan, ka bawipaw, kamaw roi nynh thua,” a cipya. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te David nynh, “Ka bawipaw nynh na ryalahtu hynh pawccemou palei nae deehui? Paw ka cyi keiccu mou? Ka kuih kya paw seinaw mou a um? <verse number="19" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka bawipaw siapharan nynh na ryalahtupaw ka bya hynh yn ngaepya tua. Kae hynh dou lan nang ae tuhoupaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> athua ze, silawnaw kha la ccou vae sah; thuasalama ccungccaw athua ze, minmin tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang thyalawnaw mue vae hae sah, pawccecize minmin nynh, ‘Cceih, ccangpaw pachia hae kha la beik hae,’ cite yn hopah hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rho laephi kya ka umbua khyh nawlan atunin yn dee hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka chii hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a um leinaw, laephi kalan lua nan sah; pawccecize ccungccaw nynh vamyng sa kheit kha mua vawlan a ccung hawte, Israel siapharan tuh uili ccangkheit kha ccung khylan yn pou vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tetuh Saul nynh, “Ka sei vae; ka ccapaw David, yn ki, ka hiinnaw hynh atunin na malang a phute keiccuze vawsawnaw papin kae pya vae lan khyh; kae tuh ka ngaee zah myarya ka cyisei vae,” a cipya. <verse number="22" style="v" />David nynh, “Pou siapharan, hein kya ccoi kha mang um! Ccangvae lu kheit nynh yn cceih sah lah, yn lah sah. <verse number="23" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ccungccaw miakaw kha a dingnaw hanlan te a lungzinaw hanlan lasung a pya kalang hae; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha ka kuih lungkhu lang atunin yn pya, thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh chitui thuhpaw kha ka kuih ka hangnua khyh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Atunin na hiinnaw tuh ka malang a phute thyhte, ka hiinnaw hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang a phute sah lah, vawsawnaw balyn kyate yn luesah vae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tetuh Saul nynh David kha, “Ka ccapaw David, na tungvaw hythuanaw um vae sah! Ryalaw patae na lah cih zah, na ryalaw kya na laan na sui a ua cih,” a cipya. Tukoute David tuh a cceih vae, Saul tuh a umnaw lang a ki.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David te Gath Siapharan Akhish</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nynh a thinlung kyakhe, “Ninkhakheit tuh Saul kuih te ka chih mamin cih; Filistin hae ram lang ka ccuepaw laeze ka hanlan ahoy huapaw pawpaw mah um vae khyh; Saul nynh Israel ram lungkhu kya kae yn ccungpaw hynh a lungthang cih zah, a kuih kyate ka lue cih,” cite a tuaku. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David tuh thokuh zah amaw te a kya um hae paw za taruh ryte Moak ccapaw Akhish, Gath siapharan kalan khe a cceih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />David te a rhawkaw hae tuh ccungccaw miakaw mawmaw innbyn raveihte Gath khua khe Akhish ryte a umkheih hae, David tuh a zu hae lu ning, Jezreel khuanung Ahinoam te Karmel khuanung Abigail, Nabal nynh a chitawpaw nomaenung ryte a um hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />David tuh Gath khua lang a ccue vae cipaw kha Saul nynh a thae tuh, ccung vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Te David nynh Akhish kha, “Na malang maehoynaw ka mue zetuh, ka um nawlan ram lungkhu e khua khuakheit kya hmin hminkheit kha beih yn pya; pawccecize na ryalahtu kae tuh namaw ryte siapharan khua kya pawccemou ka umbua cih?” a cipya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuin nin khe Akhish nynh Ziklag khua kha a pya; tukeiccuze Ziklag khua tuh atunin cia Judah siapharan khua lang a tang. <verse number="7" style="v" />David nynh Filistin hae ram kya a um ccyh tuh kum kheit sah pali acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David te a ccungccaw hae nynh cceihthung hae zah Geshur hae, Girzi hae te Amalek hae kha a thiing hae; pawccecize hynh-e minphuin hae tuh langmawlya te Shur khua lang cceihpaw laanpi kyate Izip ram kyacia a la um hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />David nynh tuh-e ram tuh thiing zah nopi pise lu kheit san a hiin te cciataw khyh hae, tuu hae, tangnuapaw hae, lann hae, kalauh hae te boeining hae kha lah hae zah Akhish kalan a ki hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Akhish nynh, “Atunin hum hae mou na thiing hae?” cite a khia ze, David nynh, “Judah ram Negeb,” tuhkhyhze “Jerahmeel hae ram Negeb,” tuhkhyhze “Ken hae ram Negeb,” cite leih a hopya. <verse number="11" style="v" />“ ‘David nynh tuhte khahte a cyi,’ cite ka konglang a hosei cih hae,” cipaw kha David nynh a tua keiccuze, Gath khua lang thongpang a thuakhaepaw a um khyh nawlan, nopi pise lu kheit sanmah a hiin te cciataw khyh hae. Filistin hae ram kya a um lungkhu balyn tuhcite leih a cyi. <verse number="12" style="v" />Akhish nynh David kha zyn zah a thinlung kyakhe, “Aning nynh a ccungccaw Israel hae kha myarya a huasaku vae hae; tukeiccuze aning tuh ka ryalahtu lang a tang zungzae vae cih,” cite a tua.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe Filistin hae nynh Israel hae kha tuk khylan mih rhawkaw hae kha a pum hae. Akhish nynh David kha, “Nang te na ccungccaw hae tuh kamaw ryte rhawkaw hae kya cciabua lanpaw kha solei la nykuh,” a cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh Akhish kha, “Myarya hoy, na ryalahtu nynh ka cyi khonaw kha na nyh cih,” a cipya. Akhish nynh David kha, “Myarya hoy, nang tuh na hiin lungkhu balyn ka pyn rhawviatu lang kae nung cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Saul nynh Chihiinleihthyapaw A Khia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Samuel tuh chih vae zah Israel hae balyn tuh rawkhuite um hae zah a khua Ramah khua khe a uu hae. Saul nynh chihiinleihthya hae paw te mitleihthya hae paw kha ram kyate khaleih a dee hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:27">Lev 20.27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:10-11">Deu 18.10-11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 25:1">1Sa 25.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Filistin hae tuh a sueluakuh hae, te cceih hae zah Shunem khua kya ryahmin a tahku hae. Saul nynh Israel hae balyn kha pum hae zah Gilboa khua kya ryahmin a tahku hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul nynh Filistin rhawkaw hae kha a muih hae tuh, rih zah myarya a thyngkuh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Saul nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha he a khia tuh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh maan te thuasah, Urim te thuasah, profeh hae kyate thuasah khungru khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Nam 27.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Tetuh Saul nynh a ryalahtu hae kyakhe, “Chihiinleihthyapaw nopi kha yn ccungpah oh, a kalan ka cceih cih zah ka khia cih,” a cipya hae. A ryalahtu hae nynh, “Endor khua kya lu kheit a um,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Te Saul tuh a boeining kha liakute ccangpaw boeining kha lawkuh zah pise hae lu ning ryte cceih hae zah khuazi khe tuh-e nopinung kya a thua hae. Saul nynh, “Chihiin yn leihpya tua, na kya a min kae hopyapaw muisaw kha yn kopya tua,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nopinung nynh, “Chihiinleihthya hae paw te mitleihthya hae paw kha Saul nynh ram kyate a dee hae cipaw tuh hoyte phe na ny. Pawccemou kae hynh chisah khylan ka hiinnaw hynh kaang nae syakhaw?” a cipya. <verse number="10" style="v" />Thuasalama Saul nynh amaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min phyate thyalawkute byakinpakuh zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, e ryalaw keiccuze na tungvaw detahnaw ccah lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Te nopinung nynh, “Hummou kae kopah cih?” cite khia zah, Saul nynh, “Samuel kha yn kopah,” cite a khung. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nopinung nynh Samuel kha a muih tuh, thawte sia zah, “Pawccemou nae ling? Nang hynh Saul nynh na thua!” cite Saul kha a hopya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Siapharan nynh amaw kha, “Rih nan, pawmou na muih?” a cipya. Nopinung nynh Saul kha, “Laephi kyate pachia yn poupaw kha ka muih,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aning nynh nopinung kha, “A muinsan tuh pawtemou a um?” cite khia zah, nopinung nynh, “Paawpipaw lu kheit yn kaethung; angkiccua nynh a kiku,” a cipya. Te Saul nynh Samuel nynh thua cipaw nyh zah, laekhu kya bakhungte sawtuanaw a pya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Samuel nynh Saul kha, “Pawccemou kae hynh pousahte kaccohkale nae nung?” a cipya. Saul nynh, “Myaryamaw ka lungriathae, pawccecize Filistin hae nynh yn tuk hae, Pachia tuh ccanglang yn hawitaw vae zah profeh hae kyate thuasah, maan kyate thuasah bya yn khung vae khyh; tukeiccuze pawmou ka cyih cih cipaw kha nae hopya ccaw cite nang kha kae ko,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Samuel nynh, “Nang kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ccanglang ae hawitaw vae zah na rhaw lang a tang vae ze, pawccemou kae tuh nae khia ung? <verse number="17" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ka kyate a ho hawte na tungvaw a cyi vae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh peenaw kha na kuih kyate lah zah, na innpaw paw David kha a pya vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:28">1Sa 15.28</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya kha na zui khyh zah, Amalek tungvaw myarya lepaw a thinrianaw kha na ccingsah khyh, tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynh-e uccaw hynh na tungvaw kya atunin a cyi vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:3-9">1Sa 15.3-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuhpiaze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang te Israel hae kha Filistin hae kuih kya ae pya cih oh; awkhualan khe nang te na ccapaw hae tuh kamaw ryte umkheih lan; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel rhawkaw hae kha mah Filistin hae kuih kalan a pya cih hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vaekheitmawte Saul tuh laekhu kya tharae dyngkuh lan khuliakuh zah, Samuel bya keiccuze myarya a rih; anin ninlang te azi zidae pawpaw mah a ae khyh keiccuze thawzung hoi vae khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuh-e nopinung nynh Saul kalan yn cceih zah, Saul tuh myarya a rikawthua cipaw he a muih tuh, a kyakhe, “Na seenung nynh na bya kha ka la ngae; ka chi ze ka chih cite nae hopyapaw kha ka ngae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu, nang nynh mah na seenung bya hynh beih ngaetua; na malang hin sanlou beihtaraw kae nungpah sah; he na cceih te na thaw a um ccaw, aetua,” a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Saul nynh phe mah zah, “Ka ae lan khyh,” a ci. Thuasalama a ryalahtupaw te nopinung nynh thawte soihbia hae zah mih bya kha a ngae. Tukeiccuze laekhu kyate thokuh zah ikhung vawlan a haung. <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuh-e nopinung nynh a inn kya thobaleihpaw vaetuataw sa kheit hoi zah arangte a chia, vaekhui kha lah zah a nonde koute ransi phing leipaw sanlou lang a rae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh Saul te a ryalahtu hae malang nungpah hae zah, minmin nynh a ae hae. Te thokuh hae zah tuh-e khuazi khe a cceih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Filistin hae nynh David A Vua hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh mih rhawkaw hae kha Afek khua kya a pum hae, Israel hae tuh Jezreel khua umpaw tuisung pe khe ryahmin a tahku hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Filistin bawi hae tuh rhawkaw za kheit phu, thong kheit phu cite aphuphute a cceih hae, David te a ccungccaw hae tuh nulangte Akhish ryte a cceih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Filistin rhawbawi hae nynh, “E Hebru hae hynh hein kya pawmou a cyi hae?” cite khia hae zah, Akhish nynh Filistin rhawbawi hae kha, “E paw tuh Israel Siapharan Saul a ryalahtu David thua khyh tou? Ka kya nin patae te kum patae a um vae, ka kya yn thua takaw te atunin cia a cyiseinaw ccangkheit san ka muih khyh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama Filistin rhawbawi hae tuh a tungvaw mih thinria; te Filistin rhawbawi hae nynh amaw kyakhe, “E paw hynh kisah tua, na pyapaw hmin lang la ki sah; tuhkhyhze tuh rhawtuknaw kya aening rhaw lang yn tangsei cih. Aning nynh a bawipaw kha bua ccawkuthui nawlan pawtemou a rae kho cih? Ah ccungccaw hae lu kha pyate ccawkuthuinaw kha rae lan khyh tou? <verse number="5" style="v" />Nopi hae nynh law biate hlaw liakuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Saul nynh athong thong te,</para>
  <para style="q2">David nynh accong ccong te</para>
  <para style="q1">a chia hae,’ cite</para>
  <para style="q2">hlaw a sahpya hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">hynh-e David hynh thua khyh tou?” a cipya hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:7">1Sa 18.7</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 21:11">21.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Akhish nynh David kha ko zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh a hiin thyhte, nang tuh a lungzipaw na thua zah rhawtuknaw kya kamaw ryte na ccia bungthungpaw hynh ahoy cite ka muih; pawccecize ka kya nae thua nin te atunin cia na cyiseinaw ccangkheit san ka muih khyh. Thuasalama Filistin bawi hae nynh tuh nang hynh mih nawccah khyh. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze atu la ki ccavae; lungdaete la cceih; Filistin bawi hae kha mih thinria nawlan pawpaw mah cyih nan,” a cipya. <verse number="8" style="v" />David nynh Akhish kha, “Kae nynh pawmou ka cyi? Siapharan ka bawipaw a rhaw hae kha ccianuate tuk lei lan ciate, na ryalaw kya ka tee takaw te atu cia, na ryalahtu tungvaw kya paw cyiseinaw mou na muih?” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Akhish nynh David kha, “Nang tuh ka muihnaw kya Pachia vaawpaw hawte ccaenaw um leipaw nynh na thua cipaw ka ny; thuasalama Filistin rhawbawi hae nynh, ‘Aning tuh kaening ryte rhawtuknaw lang cceihbua lan khyh,’ a ci hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nang tuh na kya a zuikuh bua hae paw na bawipaw Saul a see hae ryte awkhua takaw te thokuh oh lah, nang kae pyapaw hmin langkhe la cceih oh. The thyapaw kha na thinlung kya nung nan, pawccecize ka malang kou hoy lan rya na law vae. Awkhua takaw te thokuh oh lah, khua he adae takaw te la cceih ccavae oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David te a ccungccaw hae tuh Filistin hae ram lang ki khylan awkhua takaw te a thokuh hae. Thuasalama Filistin hae tuh Jezreel lang a cceihthung hae.</para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ziklag Rohtu David Phulaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David te a ccungccaw hae tuh nin thumnaw nin kya Ziklag khua he a thua hae te, Amalek hae nynh Negeb te Ziklag kha a la thiing hae. Ziklag khua kha tuk hae zah maee te a soi hae, <verse number="2" style="v" />nopi hae te khua kya um hae paw balyn kha adih ale marya a kyng hae; lu kheit sanmah chia leite marya a cciakhae hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />David te a ccungccaw hae nynh khua kya he a thua hae tuh, khua kha maee te marya la soi hae zah, mih zu hae, mih ccapaw hae te mih ccanung hae tuh kyngte marya a la cciakhae hae paw kha a muih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh David te a umkheih hae paw tuh thawte sia hae zah, rawnawpaw thawzung phe thang lan ciate a rah hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />David zu hae lu ning, Jezreel khuanung Ahinoam te Nabal nynh a chitawpaw nomaenung, Karmel khuanung Abigail kha mah kyngte a cciakhae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:42-43">1Sa 25.42-43</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />David tuh myaryamaw a lungriathae; pawccecize ccungccaw balyn tuh mih ccapaw hae te mih ccanung hae elang myarya mih ngaethya keiccuze David kha lung te deih lan cite a hoku hae. Thuasalama David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a Pachia kyakhe thawzung a lawku.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />David nynh Ahimelek ccapaw ranpibawi Abiathar kyakhe, “Ranpibawi angki kha yn pyatua,” a cipya. Tukeiccuze Abiathar nynh ranpibawi angki kha David kalan a ccyng.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:20-23">1Sa 22.20-23</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha khia zah, “E aphu hae hynh ka deehui cih hae tou? Ka phah cih hae tou?” a cipya. Aning nynh, “Deehui hae; solei na phah cih hae zah solei na luesah cih hae,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David te a kya um hae paw za taruh tuh cceih hae zah Besor Vaw kya a thua hae, tuin kyakhe abang kha a cciataw hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />David te a ccungccaw hae za pali nynh po a deehui hae; thuasalama Besor Vaw zua lan myaryasankae mih thawbang vae hae paw za ning tuh nulang a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ramkaw khe Izip paw lu kheit kha muih hae zah David kalan a cciakhae hae. Sanlou kha pya hae zah a ae, nia lanpaw tui kha mah a pya hae; <verse number="12" style="v" />thaeku thae sanlou apaekua te misu thae aroupaw nge ning kha mah a pya hae. He a ae kou tuh, a thaw yn umthui; pawccecize nin thum te zi thum lungkhu sanlou ae lei, tui mah nia leite a la um. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te David nynh amaw kha, “Nang hynh hum ccungccaw mou na thua? Tei kyate mou nae thua?” cite a khia. Aning nynh, “Kae tuh Izip ccangvaepaw ka thua zah Amalek ccungccapaw kya ryalahpaw nynh ka thua. Anuhlang nin thum lyakhe ka cci keiccuze ka bawipaw nynh nulang phe yn cciataw. <verse number="14" style="v" />Khereth hae kya-e Negeb, Judah ram kya-e Negeb te Kaleb ram kya-e Negeb kha kae thiing hae zah, Ziklag khua kha maee te kae soi,” a ci. <verse number="15" style="v" />David nynh amaw kha, “Tuh-e ccungccaw thiingtu hae paw aphu kalan tuh nae cciakhae cih tou?” a cipya. Aning nynh, “Kae theih lan khyh, na bawipaw kuih kalan mah kae pya lan khyh, cite Pachia min phyate bya nae kinpyaku zetuh, mih kalan kae cciakhae bung cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aning nynh David tuh cciakhae bung zah, tuh-e hae tuh Filistin hae ram te Judah ram kya-e myarya lungpaw luadepaw uccaw hae keiccuze ae hae, neih hae, lawbia hae zah hmin takyh kyakhe pong a pazaekuh hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />David nynh zetepakaw te awkhualan zete cia minmin kha a tuk hae. Kalauh ccikuh hae zah a ccue hae paw ccangvae hae za pali holeite lu kheit sanmah lue khyh hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Amalek hae nynh a cciakhae hae paw balyn kha David nynh bua a muethui. David nynh a zu hae lu ning kha a luesah hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ccungccaw adih ale, ccanung ccapaw hae, luadepaw uccaw hae te a law hae paw uccaw miakaw kha pawpaw mah zo khyh; David nynh atyn-are kha bua a kikhae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ccangpaw sahiin hae malang a dee hae paw tuuphu hae te vaetua phu hae balyn kha David nynh a kyng hae; ccungccaw hae nynh, “E hynh David kya-e luadepaw uccaw,” a ci hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Myaryasankae bang hae zah David nulang zuiku kho leite Besor Vaw kya a cciataw hae paw ccungccaw za ning kyakhe David tuh a thua. Minmin nynh David te a kya um hae paw kha tungku khylan a cceih hae; David nynh tuh-e hae pe a thua te, minmin kha bya a beih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />David kya a zuikuh hae paw ccungccaw hoylei hae paw te ccungkia lei hae paw balyn nynh, “Minmin tuh aening kya a cciabua khyh hae keiccuze bua ah muethui oh paw luadepaw uccaw hae hynh pawpaw mah pyabua lei lan hae, mih zu hae te mih ccaaw hae raveih kha kokuh hae sah lah, cceih hae sah,” a ci hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama David nynh, “Ka u te ka neitaw hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh aening oun pyapaw uccaw kong kya tuhcite na cyih lan khyh oh; aning nynh oun khynsah zah oun thiingtu hae phu kha aening kuih kya oun pya vae. <verse number="24" style="v" />E kong kyahin hum nynh mou nae bya kha ae ngaepah cih oh? Rhawtuknaw kalan a cceihpaw nynh a mue zeihte, uccawvaenia a ngawpaw nynh mah a muebua cih; phe ngankuh lante a neekuh cih hae,” a ci. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuin nin te vae tuh David nynh Israel hae elang phungbya te phungzae kha rae zah, atunin cia po atyn.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />David nynh Ziklag khua kya he a thua te, luadepaw uccaw abang kha a ruiban hae, Judah piccan hae kalan ky hae zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a rhaw hae kya-e luadepaw uccaw lungkhu e nanning elang lasung nynh thua,” a cipya hae; <verse number="27" style="v" />tuh-e tuh Bethel khua, Negeb kya-e Ramoth khua, Jattir khua, <verse number="28" style="v" />Aroer khua, Sifmoth khua, Eshtemoa khua, <verse number="29" style="v" />Rakal khua, Jerahmeel minphuin khua hae, Ken minphuin khua hae, <verse number="30" style="v" />Hormah khua, Bor-ashan khua, Athak khua, <verse number="31" style="v" />Hebron khua, David te a ccungccaw hae nynh khuaccongnaw khua hae balyn kalan khe a ky hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Saul te A Ccapaw hae Chinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 10:1-12">1Sh 10.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh Israel hae kha a tuk hae; Israel hae tuh Filistin hae malang khe ccue hae zah Gilboa Mua vawlan khe patae a chih hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh Saul te a ccapaw hae kha phah hae zah, Filistin hae nynh Saul ccapaw hae Jonathan, Abinadab te Malkhishua kha a chia hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Rhawtuknaw kya Saul tuh myarya a teing; thekawthya hae paw nynh kaw hae zah vaemaw myarya ccih lan a mue. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh Saul nynh a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu kha, “Na thaloi kha thuaakuh lah, kae hynh yn thuing, tuhteze nynh e vingdungawkuh lei hae paw nynh kae hynh ccianuate yn thuing lan khyh hae zah yn zuenah lan khyh hae,” a cipya. Thuasalama a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu nynh myarya rih zah thuing ry khyh. Tukeiccuze Saul nynh a thaloi kha lawkuh zah thaloi dung kha a bakhung thin. <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul a chih vae cipaw kha a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu nynh he a muih tuh, a thaloi kha bakhung thin zah, Saul kya a chihbua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhcite Saul te a ccapaw hae lu thum te a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu te a ccungccaw hae balyn tuh nin kheit lungkhu kya pynkheihlan a chih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Jezreel Accya voikheit lang raw um hae paw te Jordan vaw khuraw lang um hae paw Israel hae nynh, Israel hae tuh ccue hae zah Saul te a ccapaw hae tuh a chih vae hae cipaw he a thae hae te, mih khua hae kha poutaw hae zah a ccue hae; te Filistin hae nynh oun cceih hae zah khua hae kha a umnaw hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Awkhualan khe, Filistin hae nynh michi hae uccaw khahku lan he oun thua hae tuh, Gilboa Mua vawlan a chih hae paw Saul te a ccapaw hae kha a muih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul lu kha pae hae zah a rhawtuk-uccaw kha a khah hae, te mih zohtuh inn hae kalan te ccungccaw hae kalan thehoypaw ho khylan, locceihtu hae kha Filistin ram phe lekuh lan a saw hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul a rhawtuk-uccaw kha Astartes khozinung beikinn kya a nung hae; a rhua kha Bethshan khualungrua kya a sae hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh Saul tungvaw a cyisahnaw hae kha Jabesh-gilead khuaccaaw hae nynh he a thae hae tuh, <verse number="12" style="v" />mih rawthung hae paw balyn nynh thokuh hae zah khuazi zidae ccianua hae zah Bethshan khualungrua kya-e Saul rhua te a ccapaw hae rhua kha a law hae. Jabesh khua kya thuakhae hae zah tuin kyakhe maee te a u hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mih ru kha lah hae zah Jabesh khua e tamarisk thingku kaw khe a uu hae, te nin sari lungkhu looh-ae a sung hae.</para>
</usx>